(window.AFYA_TX=window.AFYA_TX||{})["mb"]={"mb_preg_ifa":[["Daily iron with folic acid is the single most important supplement in pregnancy: WHO recommends 30–60 mg of elemental iron and 400 µg of folic acid every day, and the Tanzania DHS-MIS 2022 found that more than four in ten pregnant women are anaemic. Folic acid protects the baby’s spine and brain in the first weeks, while iron prevents tiredness, breathlessness and dangerous bleeding at delivery. One tablet a day means a strip of ten lasts ten days, so a woman needs about three strips a month for the whole pregnancy. Take it with water or juice rather than tea, and expect dark stools; mild nausea eases when it is taken at night or with food. Afya stocks the same low-cost combined tablets used by antenatal clinics so a mother never runs out between visits.","Madini chuma pamoja na foliki asidi kila siku ndiyo nyongeza muhimu zaidi wakati wa ujauzito: Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri miligramu 30–60 za chuma na mikrogramu 400 za foliki asidi kila siku, na Utafiti wa TDHS-MIS 2022 ulionyesha kuwa zaidi ya wanawake wanne kati ya kumi walio wajawazito wana upungufu wa damu. Foliki asidi hulinda uti wa mgongo na ubongo wa mtoto katika wiki za mwanzo, na madini chuma huzuia uchovu, kupumua kwa shida na kutokwa na damu nyingi wakati wa kujifungua. Kidonge kimoja kwa siku humaanisha kuwa kifurushi cha vidonge kumi hudumu siku kumi, hivyo mama anahitaji takriban vifurushi vitatu kwa mwezi kwa kipindi chote cha ujauzito. Kimeze kwa maji au juisi badala ya chai, na usishtuke choo kikiwa cheusi; kichefuchefu kidogo hupungua ukikimeza usiku au pamoja na chakula. Afya Basics huuza vidonge vilevile vya bei nafuu vinavyotumika kliniki ili mama asikose dawa kati ya mahudhurio."],["Every pregnancy needs it monthly for nine months: a trusted, repeat purchase that brings mothers back","Kila ujauzito unakihitaji kila mwezi kwa miezi tisa: bidhaa ya kuaminika inayomrudisha mama dukani"]],"mb_preg_multi":[["A pregnancy multivitamin combines folic acid, iron, iodine, vitamin D, B12 and zinc in one daily capsule, filling the gaps left by a diet that is heavy on ugali and light on vegetables, eggs or fish. Choose one made for pregnancy rather than a general multivitamin, because ordinary formulas can contain too much vitamin A, which is harmful to the unborn baby. A pack of 30 lasts one month; it does not replace the clinic’s iron-folic tablets unless the health worker agrees, so check the total iron before combining. Look for a registered brand with a clear dose table and expiry date. Afya stocks it for mothers who want an all-in-one, trusted formula and explains how it fits with clinic supplements.","Multivitamini ya ujauzito huunganisha foliki asidi, madini chuma, iodini, vitamini D, B12 na zinki katika kapsuli moja ya kila siku, na hujaza mapengo ya mlo wenye ugali mwingi lakini mboga, mayai au samaki kidogo. Chagua iliyotengenezwa mahsusi kwa ujauzito badala ya multivitamini ya kawaida, kwa sababu baadhi zina vitamini A nyingi mno ambayo ni hatari kwa mtoto tumboni. Pakiti ya kapsuli 30 hudumu mwezi mmoja; haichukui nafasi ya vidonge vya chuma na foliki vya kliniki isipokuwa mhudumu wa afya akikubali, hivyo hakikisha kiasi cha chuma kabla ya kuchanganya. Tafuta chapa iliyosajiliwa yenye jedwali la vipimo na tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi iliyo wazi. Afya Basics huiuza kwa mama anayetaka mchanganyiko mmoja wa kuaminika na humweleza jinsi unavyoendana na virutubisho vya kliniki."],["A premium monthly refill with high basket value and strong loyalty through nine months","Bidhaa ya hadhi ya kujaza kila mwezi yenye thamani kubwa na uaminifu wa mteja kwa miezi tisa"]],"mb_preg_cal":[["Where diets are low in calcium, WHO recommends 1.5–2 g of calcium a day in the second half of pregnancy to lower the risk of pre-eclampsia, a leading cause of maternal death in Tanzania. Calcium tablets with vitamin D also protect the mother’s bones while the baby’s skeleton grows. Most tablets give 333–400 mg of calcium, so a woman following clinic advice takes three to four a day, split across meals and at least two hours apart from iron, which calcium blocks. A 90-tablet pack therefore lasts about one month and a 200-caplet pack about two. Afya stocks value and chewable options so mothers who struggle with large tablets can still complete the course.","Pale ambapo mlo una kalsiamu kidogo, Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri gramu 1.5–2 za kalsiamu kila siku katika nusu ya pili ya ujauzito ili kupunguza hatari ya kifafa cha mimba, kinachoongoza kwa vifo vya akina mama nchini Tanzania. Vidonge vya kalsiamu vyenye vitamini D pia hulinda mifupa ya mama wakati mifupa ya mtoto inakua. Vidonge vingi vina miligramu 333–400 za kalsiamu, hivyo mama anayefuata ushauri wa kliniki humeza vitatu hadi vinne kwa siku, akigawanya kwenye milo na kuacha angalau saa mbili kati yake na vidonge vya chuma, kwa sababu kalsiamu huzuia chuma kufyonzwa. Kwa hiyo pakiti ya vidonge 90 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja na ya vidonge 200 karibu miezi miwili. Afya Basics huuza aina za bei nafuu na zinazotafunwa ili mama asiyeweza kumeza vidonge vikubwa amalize dozi yake."],["Evidence-backed protection against pre-eclampsia that sells alongside iron every month","Kinga yenye ushahidi dhidi ya kifafa cha mimba inayouzwa pamoja na madini chuma kila mwezi"]],"mb_preg_ginger":[["Ginger is one of the few remedies for pregnancy nausea with good evidence behind it, and the UK NHS lists ginger drinks and biscuits among the first things to try. A cup of ginger tea sipped slowly before getting up, or between small meals, settles the stomach without medicine. Most women need two to three cups a day during the worst weeks, so a 20-bag box lasts about a week and a 100-bag box about a month. Choose plain ginger or ginger-lemon blends without added caffeine, and seek care if vomiting stops a woman keeping fluids down for a day, as that is hyperemesis rather than ordinary morning sickness. Afya stocks familiar Kenyan and premium organic blends so every mother can find a taste she tolerates.","Tangawizi ni mojawapo ya tiba chache za kichefuchefu cha mimba zenye ushahidi mzuri, na Huduma ya Afya ya Uingereza (NHS) inaorodhesha vinywaji na biskuti za tangawizi kati ya vitu vya kwanza kujaribu. Kikombe cha chai ya tangawizi kinachonywewa polepole kabla ya kuamka kitandani, au kati ya milo midogo, hutuliza tumbo bila dawa. Akina mama wengi huhitaji vikombe viwili hadi vitatu kwa siku katika wiki ngumu, hivyo boksi la mifuko 20 hudumu takriban wiki moja na la mifuko 100 karibu mwezi mzima. Chagua tangawizi tupu au tangawizi na limau bila kafeini iliyoongezwa, na tafuta huduma ya afya ikiwa kutapika kunamzuia mama kubakiza maji mwilini kwa siku nzima, kwa kuwa hiyo ni hali ya kutapika kupita kiasi na si kichefuchefu cha kawaida. Afya Basics huuza chai za Kenya zinazojulikana na za asili za hadhi ili kila mama apate ladha anayoistahimili."],["A gentle, drug-free first answer to the most common early-pregnancy complaint","Jibu la kwanza laini lisilo la dawa kwa tatizo la kawaida zaidi la mwanzo wa mimba"]],"mb_preg_stretch":[["Stretch marks form when skin stretches faster than it can repair, and they are strongly influenced by genes, so no product can promise to prevent them. What a rich oil or cocoa-butter lotion does reliably is reduce itching and dryness, keep the skin supple and make the daily massage a calming habit. Apply once or twice a day from about 12 weeks; a 60 ml oil lasts roughly three weeks and a 250 ml lotion about a month. Choose fragrance-free formulas if the skin is sensitive, and avoid products with retinoids or skin-lightening ingredients, which are unsafe in pregnancy. Afya stocks a small oil for trial and larger lotions for value, with honest guidance on what they can and cannot do.","Michirizi hutokea pale ngozi inapovutika haraka kuliko inavyoweza kujirekebisha, na huathiriwa sana na urithi wa familia, hivyo hakuna bidhaa inayoweza kuahidi kuizuia kabisa. Kile ambacho mafuta mazito au losheni ya siagi ya kakao hufanya kwa uhakika ni kupunguza muwasho na ukavu, kuifanya ngozi iwe nyororo na kugeuza masaji ya kila siku kuwa desturi ya kutuliza. Paka mara moja au mbili kwa siku kuanzia takriban wiki ya 12; chupa ya mafuta ya mililita 60 hudumu karibu wiki tatu na losheni ya mililita 250 karibu mwezi mmoja. Chagua zisizo na manukato ikiwa ngozi ni nyeti, na epuka bidhaa zenye retinoidi au viambato vya kuchubua ngozi, ambavyo si salama wakati wa ujauzito. Afya Basics huuza chupa ndogo ya kujaribu na losheni kubwa za kuokoa, pamoja na ushauri wa kweli kuhusu yanayowezekana na yasiyowezekana."],["A feel-good self-care purchase that mothers repeat and that works well as a gift","Bidhaa ya kujitunza inayompendeza mama, hununuliwa tena na hufaa kama zawadi"]],"mb_preg_belt":[["A maternity belt is a soft elastic band worn under the bump that lifts some of its weight off the lower back and pelvic joints, easing pain from about 20 weeks onwards. It helps most for women who stand all day at work, walk long distances or travel on bumpy roads. Choose by hip measurement rather than dress size, and pick an adjustable Velcro design that can grow with the bump; it should feel supportive, never tight, and is worn for a few hours at a time rather than all night. One belt lasts the whole pregnancy, and some convert into a postpartum binder. Afya stocks it because back pain is one of the most common reasons mothers ask for help, and a belt offers relief without medicine.","Mkanda wa ujauzito ni ukanda laini wa mpira unaovaliwa chini ya tumbo na hupunguza uzito unaobebwa na kiuno na viungo vya nyonga, hivyo kupunguza maumivu kuanzia takriban wiki ya 20. Husaidia zaidi wanawake wanaosimama siku nzima kazini, wanaotembea umbali mrefu au wanaosafiri katika barabara mbovu. Chagua kwa kipimo cha nyonga badala ya saizi ya nguo, na chukua aina inayorekebishwa kwa Velcro ili ikue pamoja na tumbo; inapaswa kushikilia vizuri bila kubana, na huvaliwa kwa saa chache kwa wakati badala ya usiku mzima. Mkanda mmoja hutosha kwa ujauzito wote, na mingine hugeuka kuwa mkanda wa baada ya kujifungua. Afya Basics huuza mkanda huu kwa sababu maumivu ya kiuno ni mojawapo ya sababu kuu za akina mama kuomba msaada, na mkanda hutoa nafuu bila dawa."],["High-value comfort item with few local sellers and clear, visible benefit","Bidhaa ya starehe yenye thamani kubwa, wauzaji wachache nchini na faida inayoonekana wazi"]],"mb_preg_comp":[["Pregnancy hormones and the weight of the womb slow blood flow from the legs, causing swollen ankles, aching calves, varicose veins and a higher risk of blood clots. Graduated compression stockings squeeze most at the ankle and less towards the knee, pushing blood back up and reducing swelling during the day. Measure the ankle and calf in the morning before swelling starts, put them on before getting out of bed and remove them at night; a pair lasts three to six months of daily wear. A painful, red, hot or swollen single calf is an emergency that needs a clinic, not stockings. Afya stocks below- and above-knee styles because few shops carry the medical-grade kind and mothers on long bus journeys need them.","Homoni za ujauzito na uzito wa mfuko wa uzazi hupunguza kasi ya damu kurudi kutoka miguuni, na kusababisha vifundo kuvimba, maumivu ya misuli ya miguu, mishipa kuvimba na hatari kubwa ya damu kuganda. Soksi za kubana hubana zaidi kwenye kifundo cha mguu na kidogo kuelekea goti, hivyo husukuma damu juu na kupunguza uvimbe mchana. Pima kifundo na misuli ya mguu asubuhi kabla uvimbe haujaanza, zivae kabla ya kutoka kitandani na zivue usiku; jozi moja hudumu miezi mitatu hadi sita ikivaliwa kila siku. Mguu mmoja unaouma, mwekundu, wa moto au uliovimba ni dharura inayohitaji kliniki, si soksi. Afya Basics huuza aina za chini ya goti na juu ya goti kwa sababu maduka machache huuza aina ya kitabibu na akina mama wanaosafiri kwa basi kwa muda mrefu wanazihitaji."],["A specialist pharmacy item that builds trust and carries a strong margin","Bidhaa ya kitaalamu ya famasia inayojenga imani na kuleta faida nzuri"]],"mb_preg_pillow":[["From the third trimester women are advised to sleep on their side, and a long or C-shaped pillow supports the bump, back and knees so they can stay there comfortably. After birth the same pillow wraps around the waist to raise the baby to breast height, reducing back and shoulder strain and helping a good latch. Choose a pillow with a removable, washable cotton cover, firm filling that does not flatten in a week, and a size that suits the bed. It is never a place for an unattended baby to sleep, because soft surfaces raise the risk of suffocation. Afya stocks one value pillow and premium full-body designs, as this is a much-loved gift for baby showers.","Kuanzia miezi mitatu ya mwisho wanawake hushauriwa kulala ubavu, na mto mrefu au wenye umbo la C hushikilia tumbo, mgongo na magoti ili abaki hivyo kwa starehe. Baada ya kujifungua mto huo huo huzungushwa kiunoni ili kumwinua mtoto hadi usawa wa titi, hivyo kupunguza maumivu ya mgongo na mabega na kusaidia mtoto kunyonya vizuri. Chagua mto wenye foronya ya pamba inayotolewa na kufuliwa, ujazo imara usiobonyea ndani ya wiki moja, na saizi inayofaa kitanda. Kamwe si mahali pa mtoto kulala bila uangalizi, kwa sababu sehemu laini huongeza hatari ya kukosa hewa. Afya Basics huuza mto mmoja wa bei nafuu na miundo ya hadhi ya mwili mzima, kwa kuwa ni zawadi inayopendwa sana kwenye sherehe za kumkaribisha mtoto."],["Serves two life stages in one sale and is a top baby-shower gift","Hutumika katika hatua mbili za maisha kwa mauzo moja na ni zawadi kuu ya kumkaribisha mtoto"]],"mb_preg_iwash":[["Pregnancy increases vaginal discharge, and many women want a gentle way to feel fresh. A mild, pH-balanced, soap-free wash used only on the outer skin is kinder than ordinary bar soap, which can dry and irritate. It must never be used inside the vagina, and douching is harmful, especially in pregnancy. A 200–250 ml bottle used once a day lasts four to six weeks. Discharge that itches, smells strongly, is green or grey, or comes with pain needs a clinic check, because some infections affect the pregnancy. Afya stocks fragrance-light washes from value to dermatological, with clear advice on safe use.","Ujauzito huongeza uteute ukeni, na wanawake wengi hutaka njia laini ya kujisikia safi. Sabuni ya maji isiyo kali, yenye pH iliyosawazishwa na isiyo na sabuni ya kawaida, ikitumika kwenye ngozi ya nje pekee, ni bora kuliko sabuni ya mche ambayo inaweza kukausha na kuwasha ngozi. Haipaswi kutumika ndani ya uke, na kujisafisha ndani kwa maji au dawa ni hatari, hasa wakati wa ujauzito. Chupa ya mililita 200–250 ikitumika mara moja kwa siku hudumu wiki nne hadi sita. Uteute unaowasha, wenye harufu kali, wa rangi ya kijani au kijivu, au unaoambatana na maumivu unahitaji uchunguzi kliniki, kwa sababu baadhi ya maambukizi huathiri ujauzito. Afya Basics huuza aina zenye harufu hafifu kuanzia za bei nafuu hadi za kitabibu, pamoja na ushauri wazi wa matumizi salama."],["A discreet, high-repeat personal-care item that mothers prefer to buy from a trusted health store","Bidhaa ya usafi wa siri inayonunuliwa mara kwa mara, ambayo akina mama hupendelea kununua kwenye duka la afya wanaloliamini"]],"mb_preg_net":[["Malaria in pregnancy causes anaemia, miscarriage and low birth weight, and pregnant women and children under five are the groups most at risk. WHO recommends that every pregnant woman sleeps under a long-lasting insecticidal net, which both blocks mosquitoes and kills them on contact. Choose a WHO-prequalified treated net in family size, hang it from all four corners and tuck it under the mattress; repair holes promptly and wash gently no more than a few times a year so the insecticide lasts about three years. An untreated net is only a barrier and protects much less. Afya stocks treated nets because malaria prevention is central to a healthy pregnancy in Dar es Salaam, especially in the rains.","Malaria wakati wa ujauzito husababisha upungufu wa damu, mimba kuharibika na watoto kuzaliwa na uzito mdogo, na wajawazito pamoja na watoto chini ya miaka mitano ndio walio hatarini zaidi. Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri kila mama mjamzito alale ndani ya chandarua chenye dawa ya muda mrefu, ambacho huzuia mbu na kuwaua wanapokigusa. Chagua chandarua chenye dawa kilichoidhinishwa na WHO cha saizi ya familia, kining’inize kwa pembe zote nne na kikunje chini ya godoro; shona matundu mapema na kifue kwa upole mara chache tu kwa mwaka ili dawa idumu takriban miaka mitatu. Chandarua kisicho na dawa ni kizuizi tu na hulinda kidogo zaidi. Afya Basics huuza vyandarua vyenye dawa kwa sababu kuzuia malaria ni msingi wa ujauzito wenye afya jijini Dar es Salaam, hasa wakati wa mvua."],["Life-saving essential with a seasonal surge in the rains and natural pairing with repellents","Hitaji muhimu la kuokoa maisha lenye mauzo makubwa wakati wa mvua na huendana na dawa za kufukuza mbu"]],"mb_preg_rep":[["Mosquitoes that carry malaria bite most between dusk and dawn, so a repellent on exposed skin protects a mother in the hours before she is under her net. DEET and picaridin repellents used as directed are considered safe in pregnancy and for babies older than two months, while lotions and roll-ons are easier to apply evenly than sprays. Apply a thin layer to arms, legs and neck, reapply every four to six hours, and wash off before bed; a 50–130 ml bottle used nightly lasts three to four weeks. Never apply to a baby’s hands or face, and use nets or clothing for babies under two months. Afya stocks a lotion, a roll-on and a spray at different prices so every family can protect its evenings.","Mbu wanaobeba malaria huuma zaidi kati ya machweo na alfajiri, hivyo dawa ya kupaka kwenye ngozi iliyo wazi humlinda mama katika saa kabla hajaingia chandarua. Dawa zenye DEET au picaridin zikitumiwa kwa maelekezo huchukuliwa kuwa salama wakati wa ujauzito na kwa watoto wenye zaidi ya miezi miwili, na losheni na roll-on ni rahisi kupaka sawasawa kuliko spray. Paka kiasi kidogo mikononi, miguuni na shingoni, rudia kila saa nne hadi sita, na osha kabla ya kulala; chupa ya mililita 50–130 ikitumika kila usiku hudumu wiki tatu hadi nne. Usipake mikononi au usoni mwa mtoto, na kwa watoto chini ya miezi miwili tumia chandarua au nguo. Afya Basics huuza losheni, roll-on na spray za bei tofauti ili kila familia ilinde jioni zake."],["Fast-moving nightly consumable that peaks in the rains and pairs with every net sale","Bidhaa ya kila usiku inayouzika haraka, hupanda wakati wa mvua na huendana na kila chandarua"]],"mb_preg_oral":[["Up to three in four pregnant women develop swollen, bleeding gums because hormones make the gums react more strongly to plaque, and untreated gum disease has been linked with preterm birth. Brushing twice a day with a fluoride toothpaste and a soft or medium brush, and cleaning along the gum line, is the main treatment. Gum-care pastes for bleeding gums or sensitive teeth help when brushing hurts; a 75 ml tube lasts about a month for one person and a brush should be changed every three months. Morning-sickness vomiting softens enamel, so rinse with water and wait 30 minutes before brushing. Afya stocks these because a mother’s oral health is part of antenatal care and is often forgotten.","Hadi wanawake watatu kati ya wanne walio wajawazito hupata fizi zilizovimba na zinazotoka damu kwa sababu homoni hufanya fizi zijibu kwa nguvu zaidi uchafu wa meno, na ugonjwa wa fizi usiotibiwa umehusishwa na kuzaa kabla ya wakati. Kupiga mswaki mara mbili kwa siku kwa dawa ya meno yenye floraidi na mswaki laini au wa kati, na kusafisha kando ya fizi, ndiyo tiba kuu. Dawa za meno za fizi zinazotoka damu au meno yanayouma husaidia pale kupiga mswaki kunapouma; mrija wa mililita 75 hudumu takriban mwezi kwa mtu mmoja na mswaki ubadilishwe kila miezi mitatu. Kutapika kwa sababu ya mimba hulainisha gamba la meno, hivyo sukutua kwa maji na subiri dakika 30 kabla ya kupiga mswaki. Afya Basics huuza bidhaa hizi kwa sababu afya ya kinywa cha mama ni sehemu ya huduma ya ujauzito ambayo mara nyingi husahaulika."],["A specialist upgrade on an everyday purchase, adding margin to the pregnancy basket","Bidhaa maalum ya kuboresha ununuzi wa kila siku, inayoongeza faida kwenye kikapu cha ujauzito"]],"mb_bag_kit":[["Many Tanzanian facilities ask mothers to bring their own delivery supplies, and a ready kit saves a frantic search when labour starts. A clean delivery kit contains a plastic sheet, sterile blade, cord ties, gloves, gauze and soap, the items WHO lists for a hygienic birth and safe cord care. Buy one kit per birth by about 36 weeks and keep it sealed in the birth bag; check that the blade and gloves are individually sealed and in date. The kit supports a skilled attendant and is never a reason to give birth at home. Afya stocks a Tanzanian-made kit because it answers a real clinic request and is a thoughtful gift from relatives.","Vituo vingi vya afya nchini Tanzania huwaomba akina mama walete vifaa vyao vya kujifungulia, na kifurushi kilicho tayari huepusha kuhangaika uchungu unapoanza. Kifurushi cha kujifungulia kwa usafi kina karatasi ya plastiki, wembe safi uliofungwa, uzi wa kufunga kitovu, glavu, shashi na sabuni, vitu ambavyo Shirika la Afya Duniani linaorodhesha kwa uzazi salama na utunzaji wa kitovu. Nunua kifurushi kimoja kwa kila uzazi kufikia takriban wiki ya 36 na kiweke kikiwa kimefungwa ndani ya begi la kujifungulia; hakikisha wembe na glavu vimefungwa kimoja kimoja na havijapita muda wake. Kifurushi humsaidia mhudumu mwenye ujuzi na kamwe si sababu ya kujifungulia nyumbani. Afya Basics huuza kifurushi kilichotengenezwa Tanzania kwa sababu hujibu ombi halisi la kliniki na ni zawadi yenye maana kutoka kwa ndugu."],["A must-have with a fixed deadline in every pregnancy and an easy add-on for relatives","Hitaji la lazima lenye muda maalum katika kila ujauzito na nyongeza rahisi kwa ndugu"]],"mb_bag_mpad":[["After every birth, vaginal or caesarean, women bleed heavily for several days and lightly for up to six weeks. Maternity pads are longer, thicker and softer than period pads, without a plastic top sheet, so they absorb heavy flow and let stitches breathe. Plan on two packs of ten for the hospital bag and another two to three packs for the first two weeks, changing at least every three to four hours. Choose breathable cotton surfaces and avoid tampons until the six-week check. Soaking a pad in an hour, passing clots larger than a plum or a foul smell are danger signs that need urgent care. Afya stocks value and organic-cotton options because every new mother needs them and many are unsure what to buy.","Baada ya kila uzazi, wa kawaida au wa upasuaji, mwanamke hutokwa na damu nyingi kwa siku kadhaa na kidogo hadi wiki sita. Pedi za uzazi ni ndefu, nene na laini kuliko pedi za hedhi, bila tabaka la juu la plastiki, hivyo hunyonya damu nyingi na kuacha mishono ipumue. Panga pakiti mbili za pedi kumi kwa begi la hospitali na pakiti nyingine mbili hadi tatu kwa wiki mbili za kwanza, ukibadilisha angalau kila saa tatu hadi nne. Chagua zenye uso wa pamba unaopitisha hewa na epuka tamponi hadi uchunguzi wa wiki sita. Pedi kujaa ndani ya saa moja, mabonge ya damu makubwa kuliko plamu au harufu mbaya ni dalili za hatari zinazohitaji huduma ya haraka. Afya Basics huuza aina za bei nafuu na za pamba asilia kwa sababu kila mama mzazi anazihitaji na wengi hawajui wanunue zipi."],["Guaranteed multi-pack purchase at every birth and a natural entry point to the postpartum range","Ununuzi wa uhakika wa pakiti kadhaa kila uzazi na mlango wa asili kwa bidhaa za baada ya kujifungua"]],"mb_bag_night":[["At night, when a mother lies down for hours and feeds in the dark, bleeding pools and leaks more easily. Extra-long night pads with a wide back, or disposable period pants that cover the whole hip area, prevent stained sheets and let her rest. Pants are especially comfortable after a caesarean because they sit above the wound and need no adhesive. One pack of seven or eight lasts about a week of nights, and most women use them for the first two weeks. Change them as often as day pads and keep the same watch for heavy bleeding. Afya stocks both styles so mothers can choose between low cost and maximum comfort.","Usiku, mama anapolala kwa saa nyingi na kunyonyesha gizani, damu hujikusanya na kuvuja kwa urahisi zaidi. Pedi ndefu za usiku zenye upana nyuma, au chupi za kutupa zinazofunika eneo lote la nyonga, huzuia mashuka kuchafuka na kumruhusu apumzike. Chupi hizi huwa za starehe hasa baada ya upasuaji kwa sababu hukaa juu ya kidonda na hazihitaji gundi. Pakiti moja ya vipande saba au nane hudumu takriban wiki moja ya usiku, na wanawake wengi huzitumia kwa wiki mbili za kwanza. Zibadilishe mara nyingi kama pedi za mchana na endelea kuchunguza dalili za damu nyingi. Afya Basics huuza aina zote mbili ili mama achague kati ya bei nafuu na starehe ya juu."],["Upsell to every maternity-pad sale, with a premium pants option that mothers love","Nyongeza kwa kila mauzo ya pedi za uzazi, pamoja na chupi za hadhi ambazo akina mama huzipenda"]],"mb_bag_brief":[["Stretch mesh or disposable maternity briefs hold a thick pad firmly, sit comfortably over stitches or a caesarean scar and can be thrown away or washed, so a mother does not ruin her own underwear. They are loose enough to avoid pressure on a sore perineum yet firm enough to stop the pad shifting when she walks. Pack five to ten pairs for the hospital and first days; mesh briefs can be hand-washed and reused for two to three weeks. Choose a size larger than usual to fit the post-birth belly. Afya stocks them because they are rarely found in ordinary shops but appear on most hospital packing lists.","Chupi za uzazi za neti inayovutika au za kutupa hushikilia pedi nene vizuri, hukaa kwa starehe juu ya mishono au kovu la upasuaji, na zinaweza kutupwa au kufuliwa, hivyo mama haharibu chupi zake mwenyewe. Ni pana kiasi cha kutobana msamba unaouma lakini imara kiasi cha kuzuia pedi kuhama anapotembea. Beba jozi tano hadi kumi kwa hospitali na siku za mwanzo; chupi za neti zinaweza kufuliwa kwa mkono na kutumika tena kwa wiki mbili hadi tatu. Chagua saizi moja zaidi ya kawaida ili ilingane na tumbo baada ya kujifungua. Afya Basics huziuza kwa sababu hazipatikani kwa urahisi madukani lakini zipo kwenye orodha nyingi za mahitaji ya hospitali."],["A hard-to-find list item that completes the birth bag and lifts basket value","Bidhaa adimu iliyo kwenye orodha inayokamilisha begi la kujifungulia na kuongeza thamani ya kikapu"]],"mb_bag_cw":[["For the first weeks, midwives advise cleaning a newborn with cooled boiled water and cotton wool rather than wipes, because the skin is still developing its barrier. Use a fresh piece for each eye, wiping from the inner corner outwards, and moisten pieces for the nappy area. A newborn household uses about 100 g a week in the early weeks, so a 400 g roll lasts roughly a month, while pre-cut pads and pleats are quicker to use. Choose 100% absorbent cotton that does not shed fibres, and keep it covered and dry. Afya stocks rolls, pleats and pre-cut packs because cotton wool is on every hospital list and is bought again weekly.","Kwa wiki za mwanzo, wakunga hushauri kumsafisha mtoto mchanga kwa maji yaliyochemshwa na kupoa pamoja na pamba badala ya wipes, kwa sababu ngozi bado inajenga kinga yake. Tumia kipande kipya kwa kila jicho, ukifuta kutoka kona ya ndani kwenda nje, na lowanisha vipande kwa eneo la nepi. Nyumba yenye mtoto mchanga hutumia takriban gramu 100 kwa wiki katika wiki za mwanzo, hivyo bunda la gramu 400 hudumu karibu mwezi, na vipande vilivyokatwa tayari ni rahisi zaidi kutumia. Chagua pamba asilia inayonyonya maji asilimia 100 isiyoacha nyuzi, na iweke ikiwa imefunikwa na kavu. Afya Basics huuza mabunda, pamba ya mikunjo na vipande vilivyokatwa kwa sababu pamba iko kwenye kila orodha ya hospitali na hununuliwa kila wiki."],["Low-price, high-frequency staple that brings parents in weekly","Bidhaa ya msingi ya bei nafuu inayonunuliwa mara kwa mara na kuwaleta wazazi kila wiki"]],"mb_bag_cap":[["Newborns lose heat quickly through the head in the first hours, so a soft cotton cap is part of keeping a baby warm after birth, especially in air-conditioned wards or cool June nights. Scratch mittens stop sharp newborn nails from scratching the face before they are trimmed. Choose 100% cotton with soft, flat seams and no loose threads or buttons, and pack two caps and two pairs of mittens. Remove the cap indoors once the baby is settled and the room is warm, because overheating is a risk factor for sudden infant death. Afya stocks them as low-cost essentials that every birth-bag list includes.","Watoto wachanga hupoteza joto haraka kupitia kichwa katika saa za kwanza, hivyo kofia laini ya pamba ni sehemu ya kumweka mtoto joto baada ya kuzaliwa, hasa katika wodi zenye kiyoyozi au usiku wa baridi wa Juni. Glavu za kuzuia kujikuna humzuia mtoto kujikwaruza usoni kwa kucha kali kabla hazijakatwa. Chagua pamba asilimia 100 yenye mishono laini na bapa bila nyuzi zinazoning’inia wala vifungo, na beba kofia mbili na jozi mbili za glavu. Mvue kofia ndani ya nyumba mara mtoto akitulia na chumba kikiwa na joto, kwa sababu joto kupita kiasi ni chanzo kimojawapo cha hatari ya kifo cha ghafla cha mtoto. Afya Basics huziuza kama mahitaji ya msingi ya bei nafuu yaliyo kwenye kila orodha ya begi la kujifungulia."],["Inexpensive must-have that completes newborn bundles and gift sets","Hitaji la lazima la bei nafuu linalokamilisha vifurushi vya mtoto mchanga na seti za zawadi"]],"mb_bag_body":[["Bodysuits with poppers between the legs are the basic layer of a baby’s wardrobe: they stay tucked in, keep the nappy secure and make changes quick. Kimono or wrap-over styles are easiest in the first weeks because nothing goes over the baby’s head or touches the healing cord stump. A newborn needs six to eight bodysuits because of leaks and spit-ups, in size 0–3 months; babies outgrow them in eight to ten weeks. Choose soft 100% cotton, which breathes in Dar es Salaam’s heat, wash before first use with a mild detergent, and avoid loose ribbons or cords. Afya stocks multipacks at three price levels because clothing is the most common new-baby gift.","Nguo za mwili mzima zenye vifungo kati ya miguu ndizo tabaka la msingi la nguo za mtoto: hubaki zimekaa, hushikilia nepi na hurahisisha kubadilisha. Aina za kimono au zinazofungwa pembeni ni rahisi zaidi katika wiki za mwanzo kwa sababu hakuna kinachopita juu ya kichwa wala kugusa kitovu kinachopona. Mtoto mchanga anahitaji nguo sita hadi nane kwa sababu ya kuvuja na kucheua, za saizi ya miezi 0–3; watoto huzizidi kwa wiki nane hadi kumi. Chagua pamba laini asilimia 100 inayopitisha hewa katika joto la Dar es Salaam, zifue kabla ya kuvaa mara ya kwanza kwa sabuni laini, na epuka utepe au kamba zinazoning’inia. Afya Basics huuza pakiti za vipande kadhaa katika viwango vitatu vya bei kwa sababu nguo ndiyo zawadi ya kawaida zaidi kwa mtoto mchanga."],["Top gifting line with repeat buying as babies grow through sizes","Bidhaa kuu ya zawadi inayonunuliwa tena mtoto anavyokua kupitia saizi"]],"mb_bag_swad":[["A light cotton blanket wrapped snugly around a newborn recreates the closeness of the womb, calms the startle reflex and helps many babies sleep. Swaddle safely: wrap firmly around the chest but loosely around the hips so the legs can bend up and out, never cover the head, and always lay a swaddled baby on the back. Stop swaddling as soon as the baby shows signs of rolling, usually around two to three months. Families need two to three swaddles, and easy-change zip or Velcro designs help tired parents get it right at night. Afya stocks simple cotton wraps and premium easy swaddles because they are both everyday tools and favourite gifts.","Shuka nyepesi ya pamba iliyofungwa vizuri kumzunguka mtoto mchanga huiga ukaribu wa tumboni, hutuliza mshtuko wa ghafla na huwasaidia watoto wengi kulala. Funga kwa usalama: bana vizuri kifuani lakini legeza kwenye nyonga ili miguu iweze kukunjika juu na pembeni, usifunike kichwa kamwe, na mlaze mtoto aliyefungwa kwa mgongo daima. Acha kumfunga mara mtoto anapoanza kuonyesha dalili za kujigeuza, kwa kawaida karibu miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Familia huhitaji shuka mbili hadi tatu, na aina zenye zipu au Velcro huwasaidia wazazi waliochoka kufunga sawasawa usiku. Afya Basics huuza shuka rahisi za pamba na za hadhi zinazofungwa kwa urahisi kwa sababu ni vifaa vya kila siku na pia zawadi zinazopendwa."],["Gift-friendly item with safe-sleep advice that builds Afya’s expert reputation","Bidhaa inayofaa zawadi pamoja na ushauri wa usingizi salama unaojenga sifa ya utaalamu ya Afya"]],"mb_bag_mus":[["Muslin squares are thin, open-weave cotton cloths that parents use dozens of times a day: over the shoulder when burping, for wiping milk, as a light cover in the heat or as a breastfeeding cover. They become softer and more absorbent with every wash and dry quickly in the sun. Most families need six to ten, as several are always in the wash, and good muslins last into the toddler years. Choose 100% cotton at about 60 × 60 cm or larger, with neat hemmed edges. Never drape a muslin over a pram or car seat in the heat, because it traps hot air around the baby. Afya stocks single squares and multipacks because they are useful, affordable and a classic gift.","Vitambaa vya muslin ni vitambaa vyembamba vya pamba vilivyofumwa kwa nafasi, ambavyo wazazi hutumia mara nyingi kwa siku: begani wakati wa kumcheulisha mtoto, kufuta maziwa, kufunika kidogo wakati wa joto au kujifunika wakati wa kunyonyesha. Huwa laini zaidi na hunyonya maji zaidi kila vinapofuliwa, na hukauka haraka juani. Familia nyingi huhitaji vitambaa sita hadi kumi, kwa kuwa kadhaa huwa kwenye kufuliwa daima, na muslin nzuri hudumu hadi mtoto anapokua. Chagua pamba asilimia 100 ya takriban sentimita 60 kwa 60 au zaidi, zenye pindo nadhifu. Usitandaze muslin juu ya kigari cha mtoto au kiti cha gari wakati wa joto, kwa sababu hufungia hewa ya moto karibu na mtoto. Afya Basics huuza kitambaa kimoja kimoja na pakiti kwa sababu ni muhimu, nafuu na zawadi ya jadi."],["Affordable multipurpose staple with steady repeat and gift sales","Bidhaa nafuu yenye matumizi mengi inayouzwa mara kwa mara na kama zawadi"]],"mb_bag_bag":[["A dedicated nappy bag keeps the birth essentials together at the hospital and later carries nappies, wipes, clothes and feeding items on every outing. Look for wipe-clean lining, an insulated bottle pocket, a changing mat, a separate wet-bag compartment and straps that turn it into a backpack so both hands are free. A good bag lasts the whole baby and toddler years and often a second child. Pack the hospital bag by 36 weeks with documents, clinic card, maternity pads, baby clothes and a delivery kit. Afya stocks a premium designer bag as a gift-led, high-value item and advises what to pack in it.","Begi maalum la nepi huweka pamoja mahitaji ya kujifungua hospitalini na baadaye hubeba nepi, wipes, nguo na vifaa vya kulishia kila mnapotoka. Tafuta begi lenye ndani linalofutika, mfuko wa chupa unaohifadhi joto, mkeka wa kubadilishia, sehemu ya kuweka vitu vilivyolowa na mikanda inayoligeuza kuwa begi la mgongoni ili mikono yote iwe huru. Begi zuri hudumu kipindi chote cha uchanga na utotoni na mara nyingi hata kwa mtoto wa pili. Panga begi la hospitali kufikia wiki ya 36 likiwa na nyaraka, kadi ya kliniki, pedi za uzazi, nguo za mtoto na kifurushi cha kujifungulia. Afya Basics huuza begi la hadhi kama bidhaa ya zawadi yenye thamani kubwa na hushauri cha kuweka ndani."],["A premium gift item that anchors the birth-bag display and bundles many add-ons","Bidhaa ya zawadi ya hadhi inayoongoza maonyesho ya begi la kujifungulia na kuambatana na nyongeza nyingi"]],"mb_post_bpad":[["Most breastfeeding mothers leak milk in the early weeks, especially when the baby cries or a feed is missed, and wet clothes are uncomfortable and embarrassing. Disposable pads are thin, absorbent discs with a waterproof back and an adhesive strip that keep the bra and blouse dry. Change them whenever they feel damp, as moisture against the nipple encourages soreness and thrush; mothers use four to eight a day early on, so a 60-pad box lasts one to two weeks. Choose individually wrapped, contoured pads with a soft cotton-like surface. Afya stocks value bulk packs and premium brands because pads are bought repeatedly for months.","Akina mama wengi wanaonyonyesha huvuja maziwa katika wiki za mwanzo, hasa mtoto anapolia au mlo unapopitwa, na nguo zilizolowa huleta usumbufu na aibu. Pedi za kutupa ni vipande vyembamba vinavyonyonya maziwa, vyenye upande wa nyuma usiopitisha maji na gundi, na huweka sidiria na blauzi vikavu. Zibadilishe kila zinapohisi unyevu, kwa sababu unyevu kwenye chuchu huchochea vidonda na fangasi; akina mama hutumia nne hadi nane kwa siku mwanzoni, hivyo boksi la pedi 60 hudumu wiki moja hadi mbili. Chagua pedi zilizofungwa moja moja, zenye umbo la titi na uso laini kama pamba. Afya Basics huuza pakiti kubwa za bei nafuu na chapa za hadhi kwa sababu pedi hizi hununuliwa tena na tena kwa miezi."],["High-repeat consumable that keeps breastfeeding mothers returning for months","Bidhaa ya matumizi inayonunuliwa mara kwa mara na kuwarudisha akina mama wanaonyonyesha kwa miezi"]],"mb_post_bpadw":[["Washable pads are made from layers of soft cotton or bamboo with a breathable leak-resistant layer, and after the first purchase they cost almost nothing to use. They are gentler on sore nipples than many disposables and create no waste. A set of six to eight pairs lets a mother rotate through a day while others dry; wash them with mild soap, rinse well and dry fully in the sun to prevent fungal growth. They last six months or more and can be reused for the next baby. Afya stocks a local value set and a premium brand because sustainable choices matter to many customers and the savings are real over a year of breastfeeding.","Pedi zinazofuliwa hutengenezwa kwa tabaka za pamba laini au mianzi pamoja na tabaka linalopitisha hewa lakini kuzuia kuvuja, na baada ya kununuliwa mara ya kwanza hazina gharama kubwa ya kutumia. Ni laini zaidi kwa chuchu zinazouma kuliko pedi nyingi za kutupa na haziachi taka. Seti ya jozi sita hadi nane humwezesha mama kubadilisha siku nzima huku nyingine zikikauka; zifue kwa sabuni laini, suuza vizuri na zikaushe kikamilifu juani ili kuzuia fangasi. Hudumu miezi sita au zaidi na zinaweza kutumika tena kwa mtoto anayefuata. Afya Basics huuza seti ya bei nafuu na chapa ya hadhi kwa sababu chaguo endelevu ni muhimu kwa wateja wengi na akiba huonekana katika mwaka mzima wa kunyonyesha."],["Eco-friendly, value-for-money choice that differentiates Afya from supermarkets","Chaguo rafiki kwa mazingira na lenye thamani linaloitofautisha Afya na maduka makubwa"]],"mb_post_nip":[["Sore nipples are one of the main reasons mothers stop breastfeeding early, and the most important fix is a good latch, so the cream supports, rather than replaces, help with positioning. Pure lanolin or plant-based balms keep the skin moist so cracks heal faster, and the best ones are safe for the baby without wiping off before a feed. Apply a pea-sized amount after each feed; a 40–60 ml tube lasts about a month. Pain that continues beyond the first week, bleeding, or a hot red area on the breast should be checked by a midwife or lactation-trained nurse. Afya stocks lanolin and organic options and gives breastfeeding advice with every sale.","Chuchu zinazouma ni mojawapo ya sababu kuu za akina mama kuacha kunyonyesha mapema, na suluhisho muhimu zaidi ni mtoto kushika titi vizuri, hivyo krimu husaidia, si kuchukua nafasi ya, msaada wa namna ya kumweka mtoto. Lanolini halisi au mafuta ya mimea huweka ngozi na unyevu ili mipasuko ipone haraka, na zilizo bora ni salama kwa mtoto bila kuhitaji kufutwa kabla ya kunyonyesha. Paka kiasi cha punje ya njegere baada ya kila kunyonyesha; mrija wa mililita 40–60 hudumu karibu mwezi. Maumivu yanayoendelea zaidi ya wiki ya kwanza, kutoka damu, au sehemu ya titi yenye joto na wekundu yachunguzwe na mkunga au muuguzi aliyefunzwa unyonyeshaji. Afya Basics huuza lanolini na aina za asili na hutoa ushauri wa kunyonyesha kwa kila mauzo."],["Protects breastfeeding success and sells with pads and pumps at a healthy margin","Hulinda mafanikio ya kunyonyesha na huuzwa pamoja na pedi na pampu kwa faida nzuri"]],"mb_post_collector":[["A silicone collector is a soft one-piece flask that suctions gently onto the breast and catches milk that would otherwise soak a breast pad, often 30–100 ml a day in the early months. It needs no batteries, is quiet, easy to clean and is often the first step to building a small freezer stash for when a mother returns to work. Choose food-grade, BPA-free silicone with a stable base or lid so it does not tip over, and sterilise before first use. It is not a full pump and works best in the first three months. Afya stocks value and premium collectors because they are affordable, popular gifts and lead naturally to storage bags.","Kikusanyia cha silikoni ni chupa laini ya kipande kimoja kinachonata kwa upole kwenye titi na kukusanya maziwa ambayo vinginevyo yangelowesha pedi ya titi, mara nyingi mililita 30–100 kwa siku katika miezi ya mwanzo. Hakihitaji betri, hakina kelele, ni rahisi kusafisha na mara nyingi ndiyo hatua ya kwanza ya kujenga akiba ndogo ya maziwa ya kugandisha kwa ajili ya mama anaporudi kazini. Chagua silikoni salama ya chakula isiyo na BPA yenye kitako imara au kifuniko ili isianguke, na kiue vijidudu kabla ya kutumia mara ya kwanza. Si pampu kamili na hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi katika miezi mitatu ya mwanzo. Afya Basics huuza aina za bei nafuu na za hadhi kwa sababu ni nafuu, ni zawadi zinazopendwa na huelekeza kwenye mifuko ya kuhifadhi maziwa."],["Affordable entry to pumping with strong word-of-mouth among mothers","Njia nafuu ya kuanza kukamua maziwa inayozungumzwa sana miongoni mwa akina mama"]],"mb_post_pumpm":[["A manual pump uses a hand-operated lever to express milk, giving the mother control over speed and strength at a fraction of the price of an electric pump. It is ideal for relieving overfull breasts, expressing a bottle for an evening out or for a mother who works part-time. Choose a model with a soft massaging cushion, comfortable handle and parts that can be fully taken apart and boiled or steam-sterilised; most come with a bottle and fit standard teats. Expressing should never hurt, and a mother who will be away from her baby full-time is usually better served by an electric pump. Afya stocks trusted brands at mid and premium prices, with guidance on hygiene and storing milk.","Pampu ya mkono hutumia mpini unaoendeshwa kwa mkono kukamua maziwa, ikimpa mama udhibiti wa kasi na nguvu kwa sehemu ndogo ya bei ya pampu ya umeme. Ni bora kwa kupunguza matiti yaliyojaa kupita kiasi, kukamua chupa kwa ajili ya jioni moja au kwa mama anayefanya kazi muda mfupi. Chagua aina yenye mto laini wa kukanda, mpini wa starehe na sehemu zinazofunguliwa kikamilifu na kuchemshwa au kuuawa vijidudu kwa mvuke; nyingi huja na chupa na huendana na nyonyo za kawaida. Kukamua hakupaswi kuuma kamwe, na mama atakayekuwa mbali na mtoto muda wote kwa kawaida hufaidika zaidi na pampu ya umeme. Afya Basics huuza chapa zinazoaminika kwa bei za kati na za hadhi, pamoja na ushauri wa usafi na kuhifadhi maziwa."],["High-value item that keeps working mothers breastfeeding and drives storage-bag sales","Bidhaa yenye thamani kubwa inayowasaidia akina mama wanaofanya kazi kuendelea kunyonyesha na kuongeza mauzo ya mifuko ya maziwa"]],"mb_post_pumpe":[["An electric pump expresses milk faster and with less effort than a manual one, which matters for mothers back at work after maternity leave, mothers of babies in neonatal care, or anyone pumping several times a day. Single pumps suit occasional daily use, while wearable pumps fit inside the bra and allow pumping while working or travelling. Choose adjustable suction and speed, a rechargeable battery for power cuts, a closed system that keeps milk out of the tubing, and correctly sized breast shields. A pump is personal and should not be shared or bought second-hand unless it is a hospital-grade closed system. Afya stocks options from value to wearable because returning to work is the biggest reason Tanzanian mothers stop breastfeeding early.","Pampu ya umeme hukamua maziwa haraka zaidi na kwa juhudi ndogo kuliko ya mkono, jambo muhimu kwa akina mama wanaorudi kazini baada ya likizo ya uzazi, akina mama wa watoto walio katika huduma ya watoto wachanga, au yeyote anayekamua mara kadhaa kwa siku. Pampu za titi moja hufaa matumizi ya kila siku ya mara chache, na pampu zinazovaliwa hukaa ndani ya sidiria na kumwezesha mama kukamua akiwa kazini au safarini. Chagua inayorekebisha nguvu ya kuvuta na kasi, betri inayochajiwa kwa ajili ya umeme kukatika, mfumo uliofungwa unaozuia maziwa kuingia kwenye mipira, na vikombe vya titi vya saizi sahihi. Pampu ni ya mtu binafsi na isishirikiwe wala kununuliwa ikiwa imetumika isipokuwa ni ya mfumo uliofungwa wa hospitali. Afya Basics huuza aina kuanzia za bei nafuu hadi zinazovaliwa kwa sababu kurudi kazini ndiyo sababu kuu ya akina mama wa Tanzania kuacha kunyonyesha mapema."],["Highest-value item in the zone, with a loyal follow-on market for bags and spare parts","Bidhaa yenye thamani kubwa zaidi katika eneo hili, ikifuatwa na soko la uhakika la mifuko na vipuri"]],"mb_post_bags":[["Pre-sterilised storage bags hold expressed milk safely and freeze flat to save space. Breast milk keeps for about four hours at room temperature in a cool room, up to four days in the back of a fridge and around six months in a freezer, so labelling each bag with the date is essential, and power cuts mean milk should be used in date order. Choose thick, double-zip, BPA-free bags with a writing panel and pour spout; fill to about 120–150 ml and squeeze out the air before sealing. A mother pumping daily uses one to three bags a day, so a pack of 50 lasts two to six weeks. Afya stocks value and premium bags because they are a steady repeat purchase for every pumping mother.","Mifuko iliyouawa vijidudu tayari huhifadhi maziwa yaliyokamuliwa kwa usalama na hugandishwa ikiwa bapa ili kuokoa nafasi. Maziwa ya mama hukaa takriban saa nne katika joto la chumba chenye ubaridi, hadi siku nne nyuma ya friji na karibu miezi sita kwenye jokofu la kugandisha, hivyo kuandika tarehe kwenye kila mfuko ni muhimu, na kwa sababu ya umeme kukatika maziwa yatumike kwa mpangilio wa tarehe. Chagua mifuko minene yenye zipu mbili, isiyo na BPA, yenye sehemu ya kuandika na mdomo wa kumimina; jaza takriban mililita 120–150 na toa hewa kabla ya kufunga. Mama anayekamua kila siku hutumia mifuko moja hadi mitatu kwa siku, hivyo pakiti ya mifuko 50 hudumu wiki mbili hadi sita. Afya Basics huuza mifuko ya bei nafuu na ya hadhi kwa sababu ni bidhaa inayonunuliwa mara kwa mara na kila mama anayekamua."],["Recurring consumable locked in by every pump and collector sale","Bidhaa ya matumizi ya kurudia inayofungamana na kila mauzo ya pampu na kikusanyia"]],"mb_post_bra":[["A nursing bra has clips or drop-down cups that open with one hand, so a mother can feed without undressing, and soft, wire-free support for breasts that change size through the day. Underwired or tight bras can press on milk ducts and contribute to blocked ducts and mastitis. Buy in the last month of pregnancy, one cup size up from the pre-pregnancy size, with stretchy cotton that adapts as milk comes in; most mothers need three, one to wear, one in the wash and one for night. Check the fit again around six weeks after birth when supply settles. Afya stocks affordable wire-free styles because comfortable support is a daily need few mothers prepare for.","Sidiria ya kunyonyeshea ina vifungo au vikombe vinavyoshushwa kwa mkono mmoja, ili mama anyonyeshe bila kuvua nguo, na hushikilia kwa ulaini bila waya matiti yanayobadilika ukubwa mchana kutwa. Sidiria zenye waya au zinazobana zinaweza kukandamiza mirija ya maziwa na kuchangia mirija kuziba na titi kuvimba. Nunua katika mwezi wa mwisho wa ujauzito, saizi moja ya kikombe zaidi ya kabla ya ujauzito, ya pamba inayovutika ili ikae vizuri maziwa yanapoanza kutoka; akina mama wengi huhitaji tatu, moja ya kuvaa, moja ya kufuliwa na moja ya usiku. Hakiki tena ukubwa takriban wiki sita baada ya kujifungua maziwa yanapotulia. Afya Basics huuza aina nafuu zisizo na waya kwa sababu kushikiliwa kwa starehe ni hitaji la kila siku ambalo akina mama wachache hulijiandaa."],["Multi-unit purchase with sizing advice that builds loyalty","Ununuzi wa vipande kadhaa pamoja na ushauri wa saizi unaojenga uaminifu"]],"mb_post_binder":[["After birth the abdominal muscles are stretched and weak, and a soft elastic binder gives gentle support that many mothers find makes walking, lifting the baby and coughing more comfortable, especially after a caesarean. It does not flatten the belly or replace gradual pelvic-floor and core exercise, and it should never be so tight that it restricts breathing or presses on a wound. Choose a breathable, adjustable design sized by waist measurement, and wear it for a few hours at a time during the first six to eight weeks. Ask the clinic before use after surgery. Afya stocks a quality 3-in-1 binder because it is widely requested and honest guidance keeps expectations realistic.","Baada ya kujifungua misuli ya tumbo huwa imevutika na dhaifu, na mkanda laini wa mpira hutoa msaada mwepesi ambao akina mama wengi huona hufanya kutembea, kumbeba mtoto na kukohoa kuwa rahisi zaidi, hasa baada ya upasuaji. Haupunguzi tumbo wala kuchukua nafasi ya mazoezi ya taratibu ya misuli ya nyonga na tumbo, na haupaswi kubana kiasi cha kuzuia kupumua au kukandamiza kidonda. Chagua aina inayopitisha hewa na kurekebishwa, kwa kipimo cha kiuno, na uuvae kwa saa chache kwa wakati katika wiki sita hadi nane za mwanzo. Uliza kliniki kabla ya kutumia baada ya upasuaji. Afya Basics huuza mkanda bora wa matumizi matatu kwa sababu huombwa sana na ushauri wa kweli huweka matarajio sahihi."],["Frequently requested recovery item with high ticket value","Bidhaa ya kupona inayoombwa mara kwa mara yenye thamani kubwa"]],"mb_post_peri":[["A peri bottle is a soft squeeze bottle with an angled nozzle that lets a mother rinse the perineum with warm water after using the toilet, instead of wiping sore or stitched skin. Rinsing while passing urine also dilutes it and reduces stinging. Fill with clean lukewarm water each time, rinse front to back, then pat dry with a clean towel or tissue; one bottle is used for the first two to three weeks. Increasing pain, swelling, a bad smell or fever are signs of infection that need a clinic. Afya stocks this small, inexpensive item because it makes recovery much more comfortable and is rarely sold elsewhere.","Chupa ya kuosha ni chupa laini ya kubana yenye mdomo uliopinda inayomwezesha mama kuosha msamba kwa maji ya uvuguvugu baada ya kutumia choo, badala ya kufuta ngozi inayouma au yenye mishono. Kuosha wakati wa kukojoa pia hupunguza ukali wa mkojo na kuchoma. Jaza maji safi ya uvuguvugu kila mara, osha kutoka mbele kwenda nyuma, kisha kausha kwa kugusa kwa taulo safi au karatasi; chupa moja hutumika kwa wiki mbili hadi tatu za mwanzo. Maumivu yanayoongezeka, uvimbe, harufu mbaya au homa ni dalili za maambukizi zinazohitaji kliniki. Afya Basics huuza kifaa hiki kidogo kwa sababu hufanya kupona kuwe kwa starehe zaidi na ni nadra kuuzwa sehemu nyingine."],["A distinctive, thoughtful recovery item that signals Afya’s expertise","Bidhaa ya kipekee na yenye kujali ya kupona inayoonyesha utaalamu wa Afya"]],"mb_post_uji":[["In Tanzanian homes a new mother is traditionally given plenty of warm uji, and that habit is sound: breastfeeding needs about 500 extra kilocalories and plenty of fluid every day. Millet, sorghum and fortified blends add iron, calcium and fibre, and a fermented sour uji is gentle on the stomach. No food has been proven to boost milk on its own; frequent feeding is what builds supply, but a mother who eats and drinks well feels better and copes with night feeds. A family preparing two mugs a day uses about 1 kg a week. Afya stocks wimbi-based mixes and fortified blends at everyday prices so mothers can follow a cherished custom with good nutrition.","Katika nyumba za Kitanzania mama mzazi hupewa uji mwingi wa moto kwa desturi, na desturi hiyo ina msingi mzuri: kunyonyesha kunahitaji takriban kalori 500 za ziada na maji mengi kila siku. Ulezi, mtama na michanganyiko iliyoongezwa virutubisho huongeza madini chuma, kalsiamu na nyuzinyuzi, na uji uliochachushwa ni laini kwa tumbo. Hakuna chakula kilichothibitishwa kuongeza maziwa peke yake; kunyonyesha mara kwa mara ndiko kunakojenga wingi wa maziwa, lakini mama anayekula na kunywa vizuri hujisikia vizuri na hustahimili kunyonyesha usiku. Familia inayoandaa vikombe viwili kwa siku hutumia takriban kilo 1 kwa wiki. Afya Basics huuza michanganyiko ya ulezi na yenye virutubisho kwa bei za kila siku ili akina mama wafuate desturi wanayoipenda kwa lishe bora."],["Culturally rooted, low-cost weekly staple that builds habit and footfall","Bidhaa ya msingi ya kila wiki, nafuu na yenye mizizi ya utamaduni inayojenga mazoea na wateja kuja dukani"]],"mb_post_vit":[["Breastfeeding raises a mother’s needs for iodine, vitamin D, B vitamins, zinc and omega-3, and many women start motherhood already low in iron. A postnatal multivitamin designed for breastfeeding fills these gaps without the excess vitamin A of general formulas, and some include DHA for the baby’s brain development through breast milk. It complements, rather than replaces, the three months of iron-folic acid that WHO recommends after birth, so check the total iron with the clinic. Take one daily with food; a 56-tablet pack lasts eight weeks. Afya stocks trusted pharmacy brands for mothers who want reassurance during the demanding first months.","Kunyonyesha huongeza mahitaji ya mama ya iodini, vitamini D, vitamini B, zinki na omega-3, na wanawake wengi huanza uzazi tayari wakiwa na upungufu wa madini chuma. Multivitamini ya baada ya kujifungua iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya kunyonyesha hujaza mapengo haya bila vitamini A iliyozidi ya michanganyiko ya kawaida, na baadhi huwa na DHA kwa ukuaji wa ubongo wa mtoto kupitia maziwa ya mama. Huongeza, si kuchukua nafasi ya, miezi mitatu ya madini chuma na foliki asidi ambayo Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri baada ya kujifungua, hivyo hakiki kiasi cha jumla cha chuma na kliniki. Meza kimoja kila siku pamoja na chakula; pakiti ya vidonge 56 hudumu wiki nane. Afya Basics huuza chapa za famasia zinazoaminika kwa akina mama wanaotaka uhakika katika miezi ya mwanzo yenye changamoto."],["Natural continuation of the pregnancy-vitamin purchase, extending loyalty after birth","Mwendelezo wa asili wa ununuzi wa vitamini za ujauzito unaodumisha uaminifu baada ya kujifungua"]],"mb_napp_nb":[["Newborn nappies are cut low at the front to keep the healing cord stump dry and are made for the very frequent, runny stools of a breastfed baby. Choose by the baby’s weight on the pack, not age, and move up a size when the tabs only just close, red marks appear on the thighs or leaks become frequent. A newborn uses 8–12 nappies a day, roughly 300 a month, so most families need three to four large packs every month. Look for a wetness indicator, a soft breathable back sheet and stretchy side panels; a cheaper nappy that leaks costs more in clothes and sheets than it saves. Change at every feed and as soon as the nappy is soiled, and leave the skin to air-dry for a few minutes before closing a fresh one. Afya stocks a value, a mid and a premium brand in every size so families can trade up or down without changing shops.","Nepi za watoto wachanga zimekatwa chini mbele ili kitovu kinachopona kibaki kikavu, na zimeundwa kwa ajili ya choo laini na cha mara kwa mara cha mtoto anayenyonya. Chagua kwa uzito wa mtoto ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti, si umri, na panda saizi pale vibandiko vinapofunga kwa shida, alama nyekundu zinapotokea mapajani au kuvuja kunapozidi. Mtoto mchanga hutumia nepi 8–12 kwa siku, takriban 300 kwa mwezi, hivyo familia nyingi huhitaji pakiti kubwa tatu hadi nne kila mwezi. Tafuta nepi yenye kiashiria cha unyevu, upande wa nje laini unaopitisha hewa na pembe zinazovutika; nepi ya bei rahisi inayovuja hugharimu zaidi katika nguo na mashuka kuliko inavyookoa. Badilisha kila baada ya kunyonyesha na mara nepi inapochafuka, na acha ngozi ikauke kwa hewa dakika chache kabla ya kufunga nepi mpya. Afya Basics huuza chapa ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi katika kila saizi ili familia ipande au ishuke bei bila kubadilisha duka."],["The highest-volume baby purchase and the reason families choose a regular baby store","Ununuzi mkubwa zaidi wa mtoto na sababu ya familia kuchagua duka la kudumu la watoto"]],"mb_napp_mid":[["Size 3 covers the busy months when babies roll, sit and start solid food, so stools change and a snug, flexible fit matters more. Choose by the baby’s weight on the pack, not age, and move up a size when the tabs only just close, red marks appear on the thighs or leaks become frequent. At this age babies use about 6–8 nappies a day, around 200 a month, or three to four standard packs. Look for a wetness indicator, a soft breathable back sheet and stretchy side panels; a cheaper nappy that leaks costs more in clothes and sheets than it saves. Change at every feed and as soon as the nappy is soiled, and leave the skin to air-dry for a few minutes before closing a fresh one. Afya stocks a value, a mid and a premium brand in every size so families can trade up or down without changing shops.","Saizi ya 3 hufunika miezi ambayo watoto hujigeuza, huketi na kuanza chakula kigumu, hivyo choo hubadilika na nepi inayokaa vizuri na kunyumbulika huwa muhimu zaidi. Chagua kwa uzito wa mtoto ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti, si umri, na panda saizi pale vibandiko vinapofunga kwa shida, alama nyekundu zinapotokea mapajani au kuvuja kunapozidi. Katika umri huu watoto hutumia nepi 6–8 kwa siku, takriban 200 kwa mwezi, au pakiti za kawaida tatu hadi nne. Tafuta nepi yenye kiashiria cha unyevu, upande wa nje laini unaopitisha hewa na pembe zinazovutika; nepi ya bei rahisi inayovuja hugharimu zaidi katika nguo na mashuka kuliko inavyookoa. Badilisha kila baada ya kunyonyesha na mara nepi inapochafuka, na acha ngozi ikauke kwa hewa dakika chache kabla ya kufunga nepi mpya. Afya Basics huuza chapa ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi katika kila saizi ili familia ipande au ishuke bei bila kubadilisha duka."],["Long-running size with predictable monthly demand","Saizi inayodumu muda mrefu yenye mahitaji ya kila mwezi yanayotabirika"]],"mb_napp_large":[["Size 4 is the longest-used size of all, carrying most babies from crawling to their first steps, and needs extra absorbency for long nights. Choose by the baby’s weight on the pack, not age, and move up a size when the tabs only just close, red marks appear on the thighs or leaks become frequent. Toddlers use about 5–6 nappies a day, roughly 170 a month, so a 40–56 pack lasts about ten days. Look for a wetness indicator, a soft breathable back sheet and stretchy side panels; a cheaper nappy that leaks costs more in clothes and sheets than it saves. Change at every feed and as soon as the nappy is soiled, and leave the skin to air-dry for a few minutes before closing a fresh one. Afya stocks a value, a mid and a premium brand in every size so families can trade up or down without changing shops.","Saizi ya 4 hutumika muda mrefu kuliko zote, ikiwabeba watoto wengi tangu kutambaa hadi hatua zao za kwanza, na inahitaji uwezo zaidi wa kunyonya kwa usiku mrefu. Chagua kwa uzito wa mtoto ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti, si umri, na panda saizi pale vibandiko vinapofunga kwa shida, alama nyekundu zinapotokea mapajani au kuvuja kunapozidi. Watoto wadogo hutumia nepi 5–6 kwa siku, takriban 170 kwa mwezi, hivyo pakiti ya 40–56 hudumu karibu siku kumi. Tafuta nepi yenye kiashiria cha unyevu, upande wa nje laini unaopitisha hewa na pembe zinazovutika; nepi ya bei rahisi inayovuja hugharimu zaidi katika nguo na mashuka kuliko inavyookoa. Badilisha kila baada ya kunyonyesha na mara nepi inapochafuka, na acha ngozi ikauke kwa hewa dakika chache kabla ya kufunga nepi mpya. Afya Basics huuza chapa ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi katika kila saizi ili familia ipande au ishuke bei bila kubadilisha duka."],["Highest lifetime value size, ideal for Afya Box subscriptions","Saizi yenye thamani kubwa zaidi kwa muda wote, inayofaa sana kwa usajili wa Afya Box"]],"mb_napp_xl":[["Sizes 5 and 6 serve bigger toddlers and older children who still need protection at night, when a size 4 no longer holds a full night of urine. Choose by the baby’s weight on the pack, not age, and move up a size when the tabs only just close, red marks appear on the thighs or leaks become frequent. A toddler in day-and-night nappies uses about 4–5 a day; families moving to potty training often keep this size just for sleep. Look for a wetness indicator, a soft breathable back sheet and stretchy side panels; a cheaper nappy that leaks costs more in clothes and sheets than it saves. Change at every feed and as soon as the nappy is soiled, and leave the skin to air-dry for a few minutes before closing a fresh one. Afya stocks a value, a mid and a premium brand in every size so families can trade up or down without changing shops.","Saizi ya 5 na 6 huwahudumia watoto wakubwa zaidi na wale wanaohitaji kinga usiku, pale saizi ya 4 inaposhindwa kubeba mkojo wa usiku mzima. Chagua kwa uzito wa mtoto ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti, si umri, na panda saizi pale vibandiko vinapofunga kwa shida, alama nyekundu zinapotokea mapajani au kuvuja kunapozidi. Mtoto anayevaa nepi mchana na usiku hutumia takriban 4–5 kwa siku; familia zinazoanza kufundisha choo mara nyingi huendelea na saizi hii kwa usingizi tu. Tafuta nepi yenye kiashiria cha unyevu, upande wa nje laini unaopitisha hewa na pembe zinazovutika; nepi ya bei rahisi inayovuja hugharimu zaidi katika nguo na mashuka kuliko inavyookoa. Badilisha kila baada ya kunyonyesha na mara nepi inapochafuka, na acha ngozi ikauke kwa hewa dakika chache kabla ya kufunga nepi mpya. Afya Basics huuza chapa ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi katika kila saizi ili familia ipande au ishuke bei bila kubadilisha duka."],["Fills a size gap many local shops leave empty","Hujaza pengo la saizi ambalo maduka mengi ya karibu huacha wazi"]],"mb_napp_pants":[["Nappy pants pull on like underwear and tear open at the sides, so a toddler can be changed standing up and can practise pulling them down for the potty. They cost a little more per piece than tape nappies but save time and struggles with active children. Choose by weight, with a soft elastic waist and easy-tear side seams; a toddler uses four to six a day, so a 30–50 pack lasts about a week. Roll the used pant up and seal it with its tape tab before throwing it away. Afya stocks value, mid and premium pants because they are the bridge between nappies and potty training.","Nepi za kuvaa huvaliwa kama chupi na huchanwa pembeni, hivyo mtoto mdogo anaweza kubadilishwa akiwa amesimama na kujifunza kuzishusha kwa ajili ya kutumia poti. Hugharimu kidogo zaidi kwa kipande kuliko nepi za kubandika lakini huokoa muda na purukushani na watoto wachangamfu. Chagua kwa uzito, zenye kiuno laini cha mpira na pembe zinazochanika kwa urahisi; mtoto mdogo hutumia nne hadi sita kwa siku, hivyo pakiti ya 30–50 hudumu takriban wiki. Kunja nepi iliyotumika na ifunge kwa kibandiko chake kabla ya kuitupa. Afya Basics huuza nepi hizi za bei nafuu, za kati na za hadhi kwa sababu ni daraja kati ya nepi na kufundisha choo."],["Premium-priced nappy format with strong growth among working parents","Aina ya nepi ya bei ya juu inayokua kwa kasi miongoni mwa wazazi wanaofanya kazi"]],"mb_napp_wipe":[["Baby wipes make nappy changes quick when water and cotton wool are not at hand, and families with older babies use them many times a day. Choose alcohol-free, fragrance-free or lightly scented wipes with a resealable lid that keeps them moist in the heat. A baby in nappies uses about 4–6 packs of 80 a month at home. Never flush wipes, as they block toilets and septic tanks; put them in the bin with the nappy. If a rash appears, switch to water and cotton wool for a few days. Afya stocks several Tanzanian and imported brands at different prices because wipes are among the most frequently repurchased baby items.","Wipes za mtoto hurahisisha kubadilisha nepi pale maji na pamba havipo karibu, na familia zenye watoto wakubwa kidogo huzitumia mara nyingi kwa siku. Chagua zisizo na pombe, zisizo na manukato au zenye harufu hafifu, zenye kifuniko kinachofungwa tena ili zisikauke katika joto. Mtoto anayevaa nepi hutumia takriban pakiti 4–6 za vipande 80 kwa mwezi nyumbani. Usizitupe chooni, kwa sababu huziba vyoo na mashimo ya maji taka; ziweke kwenye pipa pamoja na nepi. Vipele vikitokea, tumia maji na pamba kwa siku chache. Afya Basics huuza chapa kadhaa za Tanzania na za nje kwa bei tofauti kwa sababu wipes ni mojawapo ya bidhaa za watoto zinazonunuliwa tena mara nyingi zaidi."],["Daily-use consumable that drives frequent visits and pairs with every nappy pack","Bidhaa ya kila siku inayoleta wateja mara kwa mara na huendana na kila pakiti ya nepi"]],"mb_napp_wwipe":[["Water wipes contain more than 99% water with only a trace of mild cleanser and no perfume, so they are the closest alternative to cotton wool and water for very young or reactive skin. Midwives often suggest them for the first months, during nappy rash, or for babies with eczema. They dry out faster than ordinary wipes, so keep the lid closed and use a pack within a month of opening. A newborn may use one 50–70 pack every three to four days. Afya stocks value and premium sensitive wipes for parents who want the gentlest option without giving up convenience.","Wipes za maji zina zaidi ya asilimia 99 ya maji pamoja na kiasi kidogo tu cha kisafishaji laini bila manukato, hivyo ndizo mbadala wa karibu zaidi wa pamba na maji kwa ngozi changa sana au inayoathirika kwa urahisi. Wakunga mara nyingi huzishauri kwa miezi ya mwanzo, wakati wa vipele vya nepi au kwa watoto wenye ukurutu. Hukauka haraka kuliko wipes za kawaida, hivyo funga kifuniko na tumia pakiti ndani ya mwezi mmoja tangu kuifungua. Mtoto mchanga anaweza kutumia pakiti moja ya vipande 50–70 kila siku tatu hadi nne. Afya Basics huuza wipes za ngozi nyeti za bei nafuu na za hadhi kwa wazazi wanaotaka chaguo laini zaidi bila kupoteza urahisi."],["Premium wipe niche with higher margin and strong newborn demand","Aina ya hadhi ya wipes yenye faida kubwa na mahitaji makubwa kwa watoto wachanga"]],"mb_napp_cream":[["Nappy rash affects most babies at some point, caused by urine and stool sitting against the skin, especially in hot weather or during diarrhoea. A thin layer of zinc-oxide or dexpanthenol barrier cream at every change keeps moisture off the skin while it heals, and frequent changes and nappy-free time do the rest. A 100–250 g tub lasts one to two months used daily. Choose fragrance-free formulas; avoid talc and avoid steroid creams unless prescribed. A rash with blisters, pus, bright red patches in the skin folds or fever needs a health worker, as it may be thrush or a bacterial infection. Afya stocks value, mid and premium creams because this is a staple of every nappy change.","Vipele vya nepi humpata karibu kila mtoto wakati fulani, husababishwa na mkojo na choo kukaa kwenye ngozi, hasa wakati wa joto au mtoto anapoharisha. Kupaka kiasi kidogo cha krimu ya kinga yenye zinki oksaidi au dexpanthenol kila unapobadilisha nepi huzuia unyevu kwenye ngozi ikipona, na kubadilisha mara kwa mara pamoja na muda bila nepi hukamilisha kazi. Kopo la gramu 100–250 hudumu mwezi mmoja hadi miwili likitumika kila siku. Chagua zisizo na manukato; epuka poda ya talc na krimu za steroidi isipokuwa zimeandikwa na daktari. Vipele vyenye malengelenge, usaha, mabaka mekundu sana kwenye mikunjo ya ngozi au homa vinahitaji mhudumu wa afya, kwa kuwa vinaweza kuwa fangasi au maambukizi ya bakteria. Afya Basics huuza krimu za bei nafuu, za kati na za hadhi kwa sababu ni hitaji la kila mara mtoto anapobadilishwa nepi."],["Essential repeat item with clear expert advice that builds trust in Afya","Bidhaa muhimu ya kurudia pamoja na ushauri wa kitaalamu unaojenga imani kwa Afya"]],"mb_napp_jelly":[["Petroleum jelly is a pure, inexpensive barrier that seals moisture into dry skin and protects the nappy area from wetness between changes. It is widely used in Tanzanian homes and is safe for babies when it is pharmaceutical-grade and free of added fragrance or skin lighteners. Use a thin layer only: thick coats on a hot day can block sweat glands and cause heat rash. A 100–250 ml jar lasts one to two months for a baby. Do not use it inside the nose or on broken, weeping skin. Afya stocks trusted brands in small and family sizes because jelly is a basic in nearly every home with a baby.","Mafuta ya jeli ni kinga safi na ya bei nafuu inayofungia unyevu kwenye ngozi kavu na kulinda eneo la nepi dhidi ya unyevu kati ya kubadilisha. Hutumika sana katika nyumba za Kitanzania na ni salama kwa watoto ikiwa ni ya kiwango cha kitabibu bila manukato yaliyoongezwa wala vichubua ngozi. Paka kiasi kidogo tu: tabaka nene siku ya joto linaweza kuziba vinyweleo vya jasho na kusababisha vipele vya joto. Chupa ya mililita 100–250 hudumu mwezi mmoja hadi miwili kwa mtoto. Usitumie ndani ya pua wala kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka inayotoa maji. Afya Basics huuza chapa zinazoaminika za saizi ndogo na za familia kwa sababu jeli ni bidhaa ya msingi karibu katika kila nyumba yenye mtoto."],["Low-price, near-universal staple that draws everyday footfall","Bidhaa ya msingi ya bei nafuu inayotumiwa na karibu kila mtu na kuleta wateja kila siku"]],"mb_napp_cloth":[["Modern cloth nappies combine an adjustable waterproof cover with absorbent cotton inserts that are washed and reused, so after the first set a family spends far less than on disposables. Many Tanzanian families already use cloth at home and disposables for outings and nights. A full-time cloth baby needs about 6 covers and 20 to 24 inserts, washed every day or two; inserts last for hundreds of washes. Rinse soiled inserts, wash in hot water with mild soap, rinse well and dry in strong sun, which also bleaches stains naturally. Afya stocks inserts, covers and complete sets because they offer a sustainable, budget-friendly choice that supermarkets rarely carry.","Nepi za kisasa za kitambaa huunganisha kifuniko kisichopitisha maji kinachorekebishwa na vitambaa vya pamba vinavyonyonya ambavyo hufuliwa na kutumika tena, hivyo baada ya seti ya kwanza familia hutumia kidogo sana kuliko nepi za kutupa. Familia nyingi za Kitanzania tayari hutumia nepi za kitambaa nyumbani na za kutupa kwa safari na usiku. Mtoto anayetumia nepi za kitambaa muda wote anahitaji takriban vifuniko 6 na vitambaa vya ndani 20 hadi 24, vinavyofuliwa kila siku moja au mbili; vitambaa hudumu kwa mamia ya kufuliwa. Suuza vitambaa vilivyochafuka, vifue kwa maji ya moto na sabuni laini, suuza vizuri na vikaushe kwenye jua kali, ambalo pia huondoa madoa kwa asili. Afya Basics huuza vitambaa vya ndani, vifuniko na seti kamili kwa sababu hutoa chaguo endelevu na nafuu ambalo maduka makubwa huuza mara chache."],["Budget and eco choice that wins loyal customers and differentiates Afya","Chaguo la gharama nafuu na rafiki kwa mazingira linalowapata wateja waaminifu na kuitofautisha Afya"]],"mb_napp_sack":[["A used nappy left open in the bin attracts flies and smells within hours in Dar es Salaam’s heat. Nappy sacks are small, thin bags with tie handles that seal each nappy before it goes in the bin, while draw-tape bin liners make daily disposal clean and quick. A baby uses one sack per soiled nappy, about 150 to 250 a month, and they are invaluable in a nappy bag where no bin is near. Choose sacks with tie handles; lightly scented ones mask odour but unscented are better for sensitive households. Keep bags away from babies and toddlers as they are a suffocation risk. Afya stocks them because hygienic disposal protects the whole family from flies and diarrhoeal disease.","Nepi iliyotumika ikiachwa wazi kwenye pipa huvutia nzi na kunuka ndani ya saa chache katika joto la Dar es Salaam. Mifuko ya nepi ni mifuko midogo myembamba yenye vishikio vya kufunga ambayo hufunga kila nepi kabla ya kuitupa kwenye pipa, na mifuko ya pipa yenye kamba hufanya utupaji wa kila siku kuwa safi na wa haraka. Mtoto hutumia mfuko mmoja kwa kila nepi chafu, takriban 150 hadi 250 kwa mwezi, na ni muhimu sana kwenye begi la nepi pale ambapo hakuna pipa karibu. Chagua mifuko yenye vishikio vya kufunga; yenye harufu hafifu huficha harufu mbaya lakini isiyo na harufu ni bora kwa familia zenye ngozi nyeti. Weka mifuko mbali na watoto wachanga na wadogo kwa sababu ni hatari ya kukosa hewa. Afya Basics huiuza kwa sababu utupaji safi hulinda familia nzima dhidi ya nzi na magonjwa ya kuharisha."],["Hygiene add-on to every nappy basket with steady repeat demand","Nyongeza ya usafi kwa kila kikapu cha nepi yenye mahitaji ya kurudia"]],"mb_bath_soap":[["A baby’s skin is thinner and loses moisture faster than an adult’s, so ordinary antibacterial or perfumed bar soaps can leave it dry and irritated. A mild, pH-balanced baby bar cleans gently, and in the first month plain water is enough for most of the body. Use a small amount only where needed, rinse well and pat dry, especially in the skin folds. A 100 g bar lasts about three to four weeks of daily baths. Babies with eczema or very dry skin do better with a soap-free cleanser or emollient wash. Afya stocks an everyday baby bar, a gentle local brand and a dermatological bar so every family can match price and skin type.","Ngozi ya mtoto ni nyembamba zaidi na hupoteza unyevu haraka kuliko ya mtu mzima, hivyo sabuni za kawaida za kuua vijidudu au zenye manukato zinaweza kuiacha kavu na yenye muwasho. Sabuni laini ya mtoto yenye pH iliyosawazishwa husafisha kwa upole, na katika mwezi wa kwanza maji matupu yanatosha kwa sehemu kubwa ya mwili. Tumia kiasi kidogo tu pale panapohitajika, suuza vizuri na kausha kwa kugusa, hasa kwenye mikunjo ya ngozi. Mche wa gramu 100 hudumu takriban wiki tatu hadi nne kwa kuoga kila siku. Watoto wenye ukurutu au ngozi kavu sana hufaidika zaidi na kisafishaji kisicho na sabuni au sabuni ya maji yenye kilainishi. Afya Basics huuza sabuni ya mtoto ya kila siku, chapa laini ya karibu na sabuni ya kitabibu ili kila familia ilinganishe bei na aina ya ngozi."],["Everyday low-price staple that anchors the bath shelf","Bidhaa ya msingi ya kila siku na bei nafuu inayoongoza rafu ya kuoga"]],"mb_bath_wash":[["A head-to-toe wash is a mild liquid cleanser that works as both shampoo and body wash, so bath time is quicker and there is less to rinse from a baby’s eyes. Choose a tear-free, low-foam formula with a short ingredient list; a few drops in the bath water or on a cloth are enough. A 200–400 ml bottle lasts one to two months. Rinse the scalp well to prevent cradle cap build-up, and keep the bottle out of reach, as toddlers may drink it. Afya stocks familiar Kenyan and international brands across three price levels because a wash is part of every baby’s daily routine.","Sabuni ya maji ya kichwa hadi miguu ni kisafishaji laini kinachofanya kazi kama shampuu na sabuni ya mwili kwa pamoja, hivyo kuoga huwa haraka zaidi na kuna kidogo cha kusuuza machoni mwa mtoto. Chagua isiyouma macho, yenye povu kidogo na orodha fupi ya viambato; matone machache kwenye maji ya kuoga au kitambaa yanatosha. Chupa ya mililita 200–400 hudumu mwezi mmoja hadi miwili. Suuza ngozi ya kichwa vizuri ili kuzuia magamba ya kichwa, na weka chupa mbali na watoto wadogo kwa sababu wanaweza kuinywa. Afya Basics huuza chapa za Kenya zinazojulikana na za kimataifa katika viwango vitatu vya bei kwa sababu sabuni ya maji ni sehemu ya utaratibu wa kila siku wa kila mtoto."],["Core daily-routine product with brand loyalty and gift-set potential","Bidhaa kuu ya utaratibu wa kila siku yenye uaminifu wa chapa na nafasi ya seti za zawadi"]],"mb_bath_sens":[["About one in five children develop eczema, and fragrances and harsh foaming agents are among the commonest triggers of flares. Fragrance-free, soap-free washes with oat, glycerine or ceramides clean without stripping the skin’s oils, and many dermatologists recommend them from birth. Use a small amount, keep baths short and lukewarm, and apply a moisturiser within three minutes of patting dry. A 230–400 ml bottle lasts six to eight weeks. Afya stocks dermatologist-trusted brands because parents of children with sensitive skin are loyal, informed buyers who value expert advice.","Takriban mtoto mmoja kati ya watano hupata ukurutu, na manukato pamoja na viambato vikali vya povu ni miongoni mwa vichochezi vya kawaida zaidi vya kuongezeka kwa hali hiyo. Sabuni za maji zisizo na manukato wala sabuni ya kawaida, zenye shayiri, glycerine au ceramide, husafisha bila kuondoa mafuta ya asili ya ngozi, na madaktari wengi wa ngozi huzishauri tangu kuzaliwa. Tumia kiasi kidogo, fanya kuoga kuwe kwa muda mfupi kwa maji ya uvuguvugu, na paka kilainishi ndani ya dakika tatu baada ya kukausha. Chupa ya mililita 230–400 hudumu wiki sita hadi nane. Afya Basics huuza chapa zinazoaminiwa na madaktari wa ngozi kwa sababu wazazi wa watoto wenye ngozi nyeti ni wanunuzi waaminifu na wenye ufahamu wanaothamini ushauri wa kitaalamu."],["Premium, advice-led category where a health store outperforms supermarkets","Kundi la hadhi linaloongozwa na ushauri ambapo duka la afya hufanya vizuri kuliko maduka makubwa"]],"mb_bath_lotion":[["A light baby lotion replaces moisture lost in the bath and keeps the skin soft, and the daily massage that comes with it soothes babies and strengthens bonding. In the first weeks most newborn skin needs nothing, and normal peeling settles on its own. Choose mild, low-fragrance or fragrance-free lotions; a 300–400 ml bottle lasts about a month used once a day. In the hot season a light lotion is better than heavy creams or oils, which can trap sweat. Afya stocks a local everyday lotion, an international favourite and a dermatological option so parents can choose by price and skin type.","Losheni nyepesi ya mtoto hurudisha unyevu uliopotea wakati wa kuoga na huweka ngozi nyororo, na masaji ya kila siku yanayoambatana nayo humtuliza mtoto na kuimarisha uhusiano wa mzazi na mtoto. Katika wiki za mwanzo ngozi ya watoto wachanga wengi haihitaji kitu, na kuchubuka kwa kawaida hupona yenyewe. Chagua losheni laini zenye manukato kidogo au zisizo na manukato; chupa ya mililita 300–400 hudumu takriban mwezi ikitumika mara moja kwa siku. Wakati wa joto losheni nyepesi ni bora kuliko krimu nzito au mafuta, ambayo yanaweza kufungia jasho. Afya Basics huuza losheni ya kila siku ya karibu, chapa ya kimataifa inayopendwa na chaguo la kitabibu ili wazazi wachague kwa bei na aina ya ngozi."],["Daily-use companion to every wash purchase with gift-set appeal","Mwenzi wa kila siku wa kila ununuzi wa sabuni wenye mvuto wa seti za zawadi"]],"mb_bath_emol":[["Emollients are thick, fragrance-free creams that repair the skin barrier, and generous daily use is the foundation of eczema care recommended by NHS and dermatology guidelines. They work best applied liberally two to three times a day, smoothing in the direction of hair growth, and immediately after a short lukewarm bath. A child with eczema may need 250–500 g a month, so pump jars and large tubs give the best value. Emollients do not replace medicated creams during a flare, and weeping, crusted or infected patches need a health worker. Afya stocks a value emollient, a widely available aqueous cream and a premium eczema cream because parents need them in quantity for years.","Krimu laini za kulainisha ni krimu nzito zisizo na manukato zinazorekebisha kinga ya ngozi, na kuzitumia kwa wingi kila siku ndio msingi wa kutibu ukurutu kwa mujibu wa miongozo ya NHS na ya madaktari wa ngozi. Hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi zikipakwa kwa wingi mara mbili hadi tatu kwa siku, kwa kufuata mwelekeo wa vinyweleo, na mara tu baada ya kuoga kwa muda mfupi kwa maji ya uvuguvugu. Mtoto mwenye ukurutu anaweza kuhitaji gramu 250–500 kwa mwezi, hivyo chupa za pampu na makopo makubwa hutoa thamani bora. Krimu hizi hazichukui nafasi ya krimu za dawa wakati ukurutu umezidi, na mabaka yanayotoa maji, yenye magamba au yaliyoambukizwa yanahitaji mhudumu wa afya. Afya Basics huuza krimu ya bei nafuu, krimu ya aqueous inayopatikana kwa urahisi na krimu ya hadhi ya ukurutu kwa sababu wazazi wanazihitaji kwa wingi kwa miaka."],["Large-volume, long-term purchase for loyal families managing a chronic condition","Ununuzi wa kiasi kikubwa na wa muda mrefu kwa familia waaminifu zinazokabiliana na hali sugu"]],"mb_bath_oil":[["Massaging a baby with oil is a cherished tradition in East Africa, and gentle massage can calm babies, help sleep and strengthen the parent–baby bond. Choose a light, fragrance-free or lightly scented mineral or plant oil made for babies; olive and mustard oils are best avoided on newborn skin as they can weaken the skin barrier. Warm a few drops in the hands, massage for five to ten minutes, and wipe off excess so the baby does not slip in the bath. A 100–200 ml bottle lasts about a month. Rubbed into the scalp and left for 15 minutes, oil also softens cradle cap before gentle brushing. Afya stocks a local value oil and a classic brand because massage is part of many families’ daily routine.","Kumkanda mtoto kwa mafuta ni desturi inayopendwa Afrika Mashariki, na masaji ya upole yanaweza kumtuliza mtoto, kumsaidia kulala na kuimarisha uhusiano kati ya mzazi na mtoto. Chagua mafuta mepesi yasiyo na manukato au yenye harufu hafifu, ya madini au ya mimea, yaliyotengenezwa kwa ajili ya watoto; mafuta ya zeituni na haradali ni bora kuepukwa kwenye ngozi ya mtoto mchanga kwa sababu yanaweza kudhoofisha kinga ya ngozi. Pasha matone machache mikononi, kanda kwa dakika tano hadi kumi, na futa yaliyozidi ili mtoto asiteleze wakati wa kuoga. Chupa ya mililita 100–200 hudumu takriban mwezi. Yakipakwa kwenye ngozi ya kichwa na kuachwa kwa dakika 15, mafuta pia hulainisha magamba ya kichwa kabla ya kuyachana kwa upole. Afya Basics huuza mafuta ya bei nafuu ya karibu na chapa ya jadi kwa sababu masaji ni sehemu ya utaratibu wa kila siku wa familia nyingi."],["Culturally popular daily item with strong gifting appeal","Bidhaa ya kila siku inayopendwa kiutamaduni yenye mvuto mkubwa wa zawadi"]],"mb_bath_sun":[["Dar es Salaam has a very high UV index all year, and children’s skin burns faster than adults’, even on darker skin. Babies under six months should be kept out of direct sun with shade, hats and light clothing, while older babies and children benefit from a broad-spectrum SPF 30–50 sunscreen made for children, ideally mineral-based with zinc oxide or titanium dioxide. Apply generously 15 minutes before going out and reapply every two hours and after swimming; a 100 ml bottle covers about six full-body applications for a child. Choose fragrance-free formulas and test on a small patch first. Afya stocks a value and a dermatological option because beach outings and the hot season make this a growing need.","Dar es Salaam ina kiwango kikubwa sana cha mionzi ya jua mwaka mzima, na ngozi ya watoto huungua haraka kuliko ya watu wazima, hata ngozi nyeusi. Watoto chini ya miezi sita wakae mbali na jua la moja kwa moja kwa kivuli, kofia na nguo nyepesi, na watoto wakubwa zaidi hufaidika na kinga ya jua ya SPF 30–50 inayozuia aina zote za mionzi iliyotengenezwa kwa watoto, hasa ya madini yenye zinki oksaidi au titanium dioksaidi. Paka kwa wingi dakika 15 kabla ya kutoka na rudia kila saa mbili na baada ya kuogelea; chupa ya mililita 100 hutosha takriban mara sita za kupaka mwili mzima wa mtoto. Chagua zisizo na manukato na jaribu kwanza sehemu ndogo ya ngozi. Afya Basics huuza chaguo la bei nafuu na la kitabibu kwa sababu safari za ufukweni na msimu wa joto hufanya hili kuwa hitaji linalokua."],["Seasonal, premium-priced item for holidays and the hot season","Bidhaa ya msimu yenye bei ya hadhi kwa likizo na msimu wa joto"]],"mb_bath_towel":[["A hooded towel wraps the whole baby, covers the damp head where heat is lost and keeps a slippery baby secure while being carried from the bath. Choose soft, absorbent cotton or bamboo at least 75 × 75 cm so it still fits a toddler, with a deep hood and no decorations that can come loose. Families need two, so one can dry while the other is in use; wash separately with mild detergent and dry in the sun. A good towel lasts two to three years. Afya stocks towel sets with washcloths and larger premium towels because they are both a practical buy and one of the most popular new-baby gifts.","Taulo yenye kofia humfunga mtoto mzima, hufunika kichwa kilicholowa ambako joto hupotea na humshikilia mtoto anayeteleza salama akibebwa kutoka kuoga. Chagua pamba laini au mianzi inayonyonya maji, angalau sentimita 75 kwa 75 ili ifae hata mtoto anapokua, yenye kofia ya kina na bila mapambo yanayoweza kutoka. Familia huhitaji mbili, moja ikauke huku nyingine ikitumika; zifue peke yake kwa sabuni laini na kausha juani. Taulo nzuri hudumu miaka miwili hadi mitatu. Afya Basics huuza seti za taulo pamoja na vitambaa vya kuogea na taulo kubwa za hadhi kwa sababu ni ununuzi wa vitendo na pia mojawapo ya zawadi zinazopendwa zaidi kwa mtoto mchanga."],["Gift-led line with good margin and display appeal","Bidhaa ya zawadi yenye faida nzuri na mvuto wa maonyesho"]],"mb_bath_tub":[["A baby bath gives a stable, correctly sized space for washing a newborn, with a sloped back or newborn support that keeps the head above water while the parent uses both hands. Fill with 5–8 cm of water at about 37 °C, checked with the elbow, and never leave a baby or toddler alone in water even for a moment, as drowning can happen silently in a few centimetres. Choose a sturdy, non-slip tub with a drain plug and smooth edges; many convert from newborn to toddler use. One tub lasts until the child is about two. Afya stocks a value tub and a premium newborn bath because a safe bath set-up is a common first purchase for new parents.","Beseni la mtoto hutoa nafasi imara ya saizi sahihi ya kumwogesha mtoto mchanga, yenye mgongo ulioinama au kishikilio cha mtoto mchanga kinachoweka kichwa juu ya maji huku mzazi akitumia mikono yote miwili. Jaza maji ya sentimita 5–8 ya takriban nyuzi 37, yakipimwa kwa kiwiko, na kamwe usimwache mtoto mchanga au mdogo peke yake majini hata kwa muda mfupi, kwa kuwa kuzama kunaweza kutokea kimya katika maji ya sentimita chache. Chagua beseni imara lisiloteleza lenye kizibo cha kutolea maji na kingo laini; mengi hubadilika kutoka matumizi ya mtoto mchanga hadi mtoto mdogo. Beseni moja hudumu hadi mtoto anapofikisha takriban miaka miwili. Afya Basics huuza beseni la bei nafuu na beseni la hadhi la mtoto mchanga kwa sababu mpangilio salama wa kuoga ni ununuzi wa kwanza wa kawaida kwa wazazi wapya."],["Large, visible starter item that leads into the full bath basket","Bidhaa kubwa ya kuanzia inayoonekana na kuelekeza kwenye kikapu kizima cha kuoga"]],"mb_bath_nail":[["Newborn nails grow fast and are sharp enough to scratch the face, yet they are soft and close to the fingertip, so adult clippers are clumsy and risky. Baby clippers and round-tipped scissors are small and give better control; trim straight across while the baby sleeps or feeds, pressing the finger pad away from the blade. Most babies need trimming once or twice a week. A small nick is common: press with clean cotton until it stops, and avoid plasters a baby could swallow. Afya stocks value and branded clippers and scissors because they are on every newborn list and make a good add-on.","Kucha za mtoto mchanga hukua haraka na ni kali kiasi cha kukwaruza uso, lakini ni laini na karibu na ncha ya kidole, hivyo vikata kucha vya watu wazima ni vigumu kutumia na ni hatari. Vikata kucha vya watoto na mikasi yenye ncha za mviringo ni vidogo na hutoa udhibiti bora; kata moja kwa moja mtoto akiwa amelala au ananyonya, ukisukuma nyama ya kidole mbali na makali. Watoto wengi huhitaji kukatwa kucha mara moja au mbili kwa wiki. Kujikata kidogo ni kawaida: bana kwa pamba safi hadi damu ikome, na epuka plasta ambayo mtoto anaweza kuimeza. Afya Basics huuza vikata kucha na mikasi ya bei nafuu na yenye chapa kwa sababu viko kwenye kila orodha ya mtoto mchanga na ni nyongeza nzuri."],["Low-cost essential add-on to every newborn basket","Nyongeza muhimu ya bei nafuu kwa kila kikapu cha mtoto mchanga"]],"mb_feed_bottle":[["WHO recommends exclusive breastfeeding for six months, and for babies who do need a bottle, for expressed milk or on medical advice, the bottle must be easy to clean thoroughly, because dirty bottles are a major cause of infant diarrhoea. Choose BPA-free polypropylene or glass, a wide neck that a brush reaches into every corner, and an anti-colic vent; a 125–150 ml bottle suits newborns and 260 ml from about three months. A bottle-fed baby needs four to six bottles so there is always a clean, sterilised one, and they should be replaced if cracked or cloudy. Hold the baby upright and pace the feed rather than propping the bottle. Afya stocks bottles from value to premium without promoting bottle feeding, in line with the WHO Code.","Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri kunyonyesha maziwa ya mama pekee kwa miezi sita, na kwa watoto wanaohitaji chupa, kwa maziwa yaliyokamuliwa au kwa ushauri wa kitabibu, chupa lazima iwe rahisi kusafishwa kikamilifu, kwa sababu chupa chafu ni chanzo kikubwa cha kuharisha kwa watoto wachanga. Chagua plastiki ya polypropylene isiyo na BPA au kioo, mdomo mpana unaofikiwa na brashi kila kona, na tundu la kuzuia gesi tumboni; chupa ya mililita 125–150 hufaa watoto wachanga na ya mililita 260 kuanzia takriban miezi mitatu. Mtoto anayelishwa kwa chupa anahitaji chupa nne hadi sita ili daima kuwe na moja safi iliyouawa vijidudu, na zibadilishwe zikipasuka au kufifia. Mshike mtoto akiwa wima na mlishe taratibu badala ya kuiegemeza chupa. Afya Basics huuza chupa kuanzia za bei nafuu hadi za hadhi bila kuhamasisha ulishaji wa chupa, kwa mujibu wa Kanuni ya WHO."],["Essential hygiene-led item sold with expert advice rather than promotion","Bidhaa muhimu inayoongozwa na usafi, inayouzwa kwa ushauri wa kitaalamu badala ya matangazo"]],"mb_feed_teat":[["Teats wear out faster than bottles: silicone becomes sticky, thin or torn with repeated boiling, and a split teat can release a piece a baby could choke on. Check teats before every feed by pulling gently and replace them every two to three months, or at once if damaged. Flow levels matter: a newborn needs a slow-flow teat, and moving up too early causes gulping, coughing and wind. Buy teats of the same brand as the bottle so they fit and seal properly. Afya stocks teats for the bottle brands it sells, in every flow level, so families can keep feeding safe.","Nyonyo huchakaa haraka kuliko chupa: silikoni hunata, huwa nyembamba au hupasuka kwa kuchemshwa mara kwa mara, na nyonyo iliyopasuka inaweza kutoa kipande ambacho mtoto anaweza kukisakama kooni. Kagua nyonyo kabla ya kila mlo kwa kuivuta kwa upole na zibadilishe kila miezi miwili hadi mitatu, au mara moja zikiharibika. Kasi ya maziwa ni muhimu: mtoto mchanga anahitaji nyonyo ya kasi ndogo, na kupanda kasi mapema mno husababisha kumeza kwa haraka, kukohoa na gesi. Nunua nyonyo za chapa ileile ya chupa ili zikae na kufunga vizuri. Afya Basics huuza nyonyo za chapa za chupa inazouza, katika kila kiwango cha kasi, ili familia ziendelee kulisha kwa usalama."],["Recurring replacement purchase tied to every bottle sold","Ununuzi wa kubadilisha unaorudiwa unaofungamana na kila chupa inayouzwa"]],"mb_feed_brush":[["Sterilising only works on bottles that are already clean, because dried milk shields bacteria from heat and chemicals. A long-handled bottle brush with a narrow teat brush reaches the base, shoulders and teat tip where fat collects. Wash in hot soapy water straight after each feed, rinse, then sterilise; replace the brush every one to two months or when bristles splay, as old brushes harbour germs. Choose a brush with a sponge tip for scratch-free cleaning and a stand so it dries upright. Afya stocks brushes at three price points because clean equipment is the first defence against diarrhoea in bottle-fed babies.","Kuua vijidudu hufanya kazi tu kwa chupa ambazo tayari ni safi, kwa sababu maziwa yaliyokauka hukinga bakteria dhidi ya joto na kemikali. Brashi ya chupa yenye mpini mrefu pamoja na brashi ndogo ya nyonyo hufikia kitako, mabega na ncha ya nyonyo ambako mafuta hujikusanya. Osha kwa maji ya moto yenye sabuni mara tu baada ya kila mlo, suuza, kisha ua vijidudu; badilisha brashi kila mwezi mmoja hadi miwili au manyoya yanapotawanyika, kwa kuwa brashi kuu huficha vijidudu. Chagua brashi yenye ncha ya sponji kwa kusafisha bila kukwaruza na kishikio cha kuisimamisha ikauke wima. Afya Basics huuza brashi za viwango vitatu vya bei kwa sababu vifaa safi ndiyo kinga ya kwanza dhidi ya kuharisha kwa watoto wanaolishwa kwa chupa."],["Cheap, frequently replaced hygiene item that pairs with every bottle sale","Bidhaa ya usafi ya bei nafuu inayobadilishwa mara kwa mara na kuendana na kila chupa"]],"mb_feed_steril":[["Until about 12 months, a baby’s immune system is immature, and the NHS advises sterilising all feeding equipment after washing. Boiling for ten minutes works but is time-consuming and hard on teats; an electric or microwave steam steriliser does a full load of bottles in five to ten minutes and keeps them sterile for several hours if the lid stays closed. Choose a capacity of at least four to six bottles, check that the household microwave fits a microwave model, and descale electric units monthly in hard-water areas. During power cuts, boiling or cold-water sterilising tablets are the backup. Afya stocks a microwave and an electric model because they save busy parents hours every week.","Hadi takriban miezi 12, kinga ya mwili ya mtoto bado haijakomaa, na Huduma ya Afya ya Uingereza (NHS) inashauri kuua vijidudu kwenye vifaa vyote vya kulishia baada ya kuviosha. Kuchemsha kwa dakika kumi hufanya kazi lakini huchukua muda na huharibu nyonyo; mashine ya mvuke ya umeme au ya microwave huua vijidudu kwenye chupa kadhaa kwa dakika tano hadi kumi na kuziweka safi kwa saa kadhaa kifuniko kikibaki kimefungwa. Chagua yenye uwezo wa angalau chupa nne hadi sita, hakikisha microwave ya nyumbani inaingiza aina ya microwave, na ondoa ukoko wa chumvi kwenye mashine za umeme kila mwezi katika maeneo yenye maji mazito. Umeme ukikatika, kuchemsha au vidonge vya kuua vijidudu kwa maji baridi ndiyo njia mbadala. Afya Basics huuza aina ya microwave na ya umeme kwa sababu huokoa wazazi walio na shughuli nyingi saa nyingi kila wiki."],["High-value appliance that is a classic baby-shower group gift","Kifaa chenye thamani kubwa ambacho ni zawadi ya jadi ya pamoja kwenye sherehe za kumkaribisha mtoto"]],"mb_feed_sterfluid":[["Cold-water sterilising uses a mild chlorine solution to sterilise bottles, teats, soothers and pump parts without heat or electricity, which makes it ideal for power cuts, travel and homes without a steriliser. Dissolve one tablet or the measured fluid in the stated volume of clean cold water in a lidded container, fully submerge the clean items with no trapped air, and leave for at least 15 minutes; the solution stays active for 24 hours. A pack of 28 tablets gives four weeks of daily sterilising. Do not rinse items afterwards with unboiled water, and keep the product away from children. Afya stocks tablets and fluid because they are a reliable backup in Dar es Salaam’s power cuts.","Kuua vijidudu kwa maji baridi hutumia mchanganyiko mdogo wa klorini kusafisha chupa, nyonyo, nyonyo bandia na vipuri vya pampu bila joto wala umeme, jambo linalofanya kufae sana umeme ukikatika, safarini na nyumba zisizo na mashine ya kuua vijidudu. Yeyusha kidonge kimoja au kipimo cha kimiminika katika kiasi kilichoelezwa cha maji safi ya baridi ndani ya chombo chenye mfuniko, zamisha vifaa safi kikamilifu bila hewa ndani yake, na acha kwa angalau dakika 15; mchanganyiko hubaki na nguvu kwa saa 24. Pakiti ya vidonge 28 hutosha wiki nne za kuua vijidudu kila siku. Usisuuze vifaa baadaye kwa maji ambayo hayajachemshwa, na weka bidhaa mbali na watoto. Afya Basics huuza vidonge na kimiminika kwa sababu ni njia mbadala ya kuaminika wakati umeme unapokatika Dar es Salaam."],["Practical, repeat consumable well suited to local power conditions","Bidhaa ya matumizi ya kurudia inayofaa hali ya umeme ya hapa nchini"]],"mb_feed_cup":[["WHO and UNICEF encourage cup feeding over bottles because cups are easier to keep clean and support oral development, and even small babies can be fed expressed milk from a small open cup by a trained carer. From six months, offering water in an open cup at meals helps a baby learn to sip and reduces the risk of tooth decay from long bottle use. Choose small, light cups with a wide base that a baby can grip; free-flow beakers are a step between bottle and cup. Wash after every use, and replace cups when scratched. Afya stocks simple open cups and training cups to help families move away from bottles by the first birthday.","WHO na UNICEF huhamasisha kulisha kwa kikombe badala ya chupa kwa sababu vikombe ni rahisi kuviweka safi na husaidia ukuaji wa kinywa, na hata watoto wadogo wanaweza kulishwa maziwa yaliyokamuliwa kwa kikombe kidogo cha wazi na mlezi aliyefundishwa. Kuanzia miezi sita, kumpa mtoto maji kwa kikombe cha wazi wakati wa milo humsaidia kujifunza kunywa na hupunguza hatari ya meno kuoza kutokana na kutumia chupa kwa muda mrefu. Chagua vikombe vidogo vyepesi vyenye kitako kipana ambavyo mtoto anaweza kushika; vikombe vyenye mdomo wa kumimina ni hatua kati ya chupa na kikombe. Osha baada ya kila matumizi na badilisha vikombe vikikwaruzika. Afya Basics huuza vikombe rahisi vya wazi na vya kujifunzia kusaidia familia kuacha chupa kufikia siku ya kuzaliwa ya kwanza."],["Affordable, evidence-led feeding tool that reflects Afya’s health-first values","Kifaa cha kulishia chenye ushahidi na bei nafuu kinachoakisi maadili ya Afya ya kutanguliza afya"]],"mb_feed_straw":[["A straw cup builds the mouth muscles used for speech and is often easier for toddlers than a spouted sippy cup, which encourages the same sucking pattern as a bottle. Weighted-straw designs let a child drink at any angle, and spill-proof valves keep bags dry, while insulated cups keep water cool in the heat. Offer plain water or milk only, not juice or sweet drinks, to protect new teeth. Choose BPA-free cups with parts that come apart completely, because straws and valves trap milk; clean straws with a narrow brush daily. Afya stocks value, mid and premium straw cups because they are bought for nursery, travel and as gifts.","Kikombe cha mrija hujenga misuli ya kinywa inayotumika kuzungumza na mara nyingi ni rahisi kwa watoto wadogo kuliko kikombe chenye mdomo, ambacho huchochea mtindo uleule wa kunyonya kama chupa. Aina zenye mrija wenye uzito humwezesha mtoto kunywa kwa pembe yoyote, vali zisizovuja huweka mabegi makavu, na vikombe vinavyohifadhi baridi huweka maji ya baridi wakati wa joto. Mpe maji matupu au maziwa tu, si juisi wala vinywaji vitamu, ili kulinda meno mapya. Chagua vikombe visivyo na BPA vyenye sehemu zinazofunguliwa kikamilifu, kwa sababu mirija na vali hufungia maziwa; safisha mirija kila siku kwa brashi nyembamba. Afya Basics huuza vikombe vya mrija vya bei nafuu, vya kati na vya hadhi kwa sababu hununuliwa kwa ajili ya shule ya awali, safari na zawadi."],["Toddler item with repeat and gift demand at a healthy margin","Bidhaa ya mtoto mdogo yenye mahitaji ya kurudia na ya zawadi kwa faida nzuri"]],"mb_feed_bowl":[["WHO recommends starting complementary food at six months while continuing breastfeeding, beginning with thick porridges and mashed foods two to three times a day. Soft-tipped spoons are gentle on gums and the right size for a baby’s mouth, and a suction bowl stays put on a table or tray when a curious baby grabs it. Choose BPA-free silicone or polypropylene that tolerates hot water, avoid melamine for hot food, and wash after every meal. A set of two spoons and one bowl covers the first year. Afya stocks soft spoons and bowls at three price levels to support good complementary feeding practice.","Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri kuanza chakula cha nyongeza katika miezi sita huku kunyonyesha kukiendelea, kuanzia na uji mzito na vyakula vilivyopondwa mara mbili hadi tatu kwa siku. Vijiko vyenye ncha laini ni vya upole kwa fizi na vina saizi inayofaa mdomo wa mtoto, na bakuli linalonata hubaki mezani au kwenye trei mtoto mdadisi anapolivuta. Chagua silikoni au polypropylene isiyo na BPA inayostahimili maji ya moto, epuka melamine kwa chakula cha moto, na osha baada ya kila mlo. Seti ya vijiko viwili na bakuli moja hutosha mwaka wa kwanza. Afya Basics huuza vijiko laini na bakuli katika viwango vitatu vya bei kusaidia ulishaji bora wa chakula cha nyongeza."],["Key weaning starter item that links to Afya’s uji and cereal range","Bidhaa muhimu ya kuanzisha chakula inayounganisha na bidhaa za uji na nafaka za Afya"]],"mb_feed_bib":[["Learning to eat is messy, and bibs save clothes and laundry time. Waterproof, wipe-clean bibs with a crumb pocket work best for meals, while long-sleeved apron bibs cover the arms during self-feeding. Soft cotton bibs absorb dribble during teething and stop chin rashes. Families need three to five bibs for daily use; avoid ties that can tighten around the neck and always remove bibs before sleep. Afya stocks simple and long-sleeved bibs because they are inexpensive, practical and popular in gift sets.","Kujifunza kula ni kazi yenye uchafu, na bibu huokoa nguo na muda wa kufua. Bibu zisizopitisha maji zinazofutika zenye mfuko wa kunasa makombo hufaa zaidi wakati wa milo, na bibu za aproni zenye mikono mirefu hufunika mikono mtoto anapojilisha. Bibu laini za pamba hunyonya udenda wakati wa kuota meno na kuzuia vipele vya kidevu. Familia huhitaji bibu tatu hadi tano kwa matumizi ya kila siku; epuka zenye kamba zinazoweza kubana shingoni na mvue bibu kabla ya kulala daima. Afya Basics huuza bibu rahisi na zenye mikono mirefu kwa sababu ni nafuu, za vitendo na zinapendwa katika seti za zawadi."],["Low-cost add-on that lifts weaning and gift baskets","Nyongeza ya bei nafuu inayoongeza vikapu vya kuanzisha chakula na zawadi"]],"mb_feed_feeder":[["A fresh-food feeder is a handle with a mesh or silicone pouch: soft fruit such as banana, mango or pawpaw goes inside, and the baby sucks and chews it without the risk of large pieces. Chilled fruit inside also soothes teething gums. It lets a baby take part in family meals and explore tastes, but it is a supplement to, not a replacement for, spoon-fed porridges and mashed meals that provide energy and iron. Choose silicone pouches, which are easier to clean than mesh, wash immediately after use and replace when torn. Afya stocks a value and premium feeder as a popular weaning and gift item.","Kilisha matunda ni mpini wenye mfuko wa neti au silikoni: matunda laini kama ndizi, embe au papai huwekwa ndani, na mtoto hunyonya na kutafuna bila hatari ya vipande vikubwa. Matunda yaliyopozwa ndani yake pia hutuliza fizi zinazoota meno. Humwezesha mtoto kushiriki milo ya familia na kujaribu ladha, lakini ni nyongeza na si mbadala wa uji na vyakula vilivyopondwa vinavyolishwa kwa kijiko vinavyotoa nishati na madini chuma. Chagua mifuko ya silikoni, ambayo ni rahisi kusafisha kuliko neti, osha mara baada ya kutumia na badilisha ikichanika. Afya Basics huuza kilisha cha bei nafuu na cha hadhi kama bidhaa inayopendwa ya kuanzisha chakula na zawadi."],["Popular, affordable weaning gadget that sells on impulse at the till","Kifaa maarufu na nafuu cha kuanzisha chakula kinachonunuliwa kwa haraka karibu na kaunta"]],"mb_feed_chair":[["Sitting upright at mealtimes is essential for safe swallowing and reduces choking, and a dedicated seat lets a baby join family meals. A booster seat straps onto an ordinary chair and folds for travel, while a full high chair has its own legs and a tray. Choose a five-point or three-point harness, a wide stable base, a removable wipe-clean tray and no gaps where fingers can be trapped. Always use the harness, never leave the baby alone, and keep the chair away from walls and counters a baby could push against. Afya stocks a portable booster and a full high chair because they are high-value purchases that support safe feeding.","Kuketi wima wakati wa milo ni muhimu kwa kumeza kwa usalama na hupunguza kusakamwa, na kiti maalum humwezesha mtoto kujumuika katika milo ya familia. Kiti cha kuongeza urefu hufungwa juu ya kiti cha kawaida na hukunjwa kwa safari, na kiti kamili cha juu kina miguu yake na trei. Chagua chenye mkanda wa sehemu tano au tatu, kitako kipana imara, trei inayotolewa na kufutika, na bila mianya ambayo vidole vinaweza kubanwa. Tumia mkanda daima, usimwache mtoto peke yake, na weka kiti mbali na kuta na meza ambazo mtoto anaweza kuzisukuma. Afya Basics huuza kiti kinachobebeka na kiti kamili cha juu kwa sababu ni ununuzi wenye thamani kubwa unaosaidia ulishaji salama."],["Large, high-value purchase that anchors the weaning display","Ununuzi mkubwa wenye thamani unaoongoza maonyesho ya kuanzisha chakula"]],"mb_hlth_therm":[["In Tanzania, fever in a young child must be taken seriously because it can signal malaria or pneumonia, and a thermometer turns a worried guess into a clear number. A digital stick thermometer used in the armpit is accurate, safe and inexpensive; flexible tips are more comfortable for babies. A reading of 37.5 °C or more is a fever, and any fever in a baby under three months, or fever with fast breathing, convulsions, drowsiness or refusal to feed, needs care the same day. Clean the tip with an alcohol swab after each use and keep a spare battery. Glass mercury thermometers should be avoided. Afya stocks reliable, registered thermometers at three price levels because every home with a child should own one.","Nchini Tanzania, homa kwa mtoto mdogo lazima ichukuliwe kwa uzito kwa sababu inaweza kuashiria malaria au nimonia, na kipimajoto hubadilisha wasiwasi wa kubahatisha kuwa namba iliyo wazi. Kipimajoto cha kidijitali cha kijiti kinachowekwa kwapani ni sahihi, salama na cha bei nafuu; vyenye ncha inayopinda ni vya starehe zaidi kwa watoto. Kipimo cha nyuzi 37.5 au zaidi ni homa, na homa yoyote kwa mtoto chini ya miezi mitatu, au homa pamoja na kupumua haraka, degedege, kusinzia sana au kukataa kunyonya, inahitaji huduma siku hiyohiyo. Safisha ncha kwa kipande cha pombe baada ya kila matumizi na weka betri ya akiba. Vipimajoto vya kioo vyenye zebaki viepukwe. Afya Basics huuza vipimajoto vya kuaminika vilivyosajiliwa katika viwango vitatu vya bei kwa sababu kila nyumba yenye mtoto inapaswa kuwa nacho."],["Must-own device that establishes Afya as the family’s health shop","Kifaa cha lazima kinachoifanya Afya kuwa duka la afya la familia"]],"mb_hlth_asp":[["Babies breathe mainly through the nose, so a cold that blocks it makes feeding and sleeping difficult. After loosening mucus with saline drops, a nasal aspirator gently removes it: bulb types are simple, tube types let the parent control suction, and electric types are quick and easy. Use only before feeds and sleep, no more than three to four times a day, as overuse irritates the lining. Wash and dry every part after each use and never share between children. Fast breathing, chest in-drawing or a baby who cannot feed needs a clinic, not suction. Afya stocks a simple, a saline kit and an electric aspirator because blocked noses are among the commonest reasons parents seek help in the rainy seasons.","Watoto hupumua zaidi kupitia pua, hivyo mafua yanayoziba pua hufanya kunyonya na kulala kuwa vigumu. Baada ya kulainisha kamasi kwa matone ya chumvi, kifaa cha kuvuta kamasi huziondoa kwa upole: aina za mpira ni rahisi, aina za mrija humwezesha mzazi kudhibiti nguvu ya kuvuta, na aina za umeme ni za haraka na rahisi. Tumia kabla ya kunyonya na kulala tu, si zaidi ya mara tatu hadi nne kwa siku, kwa kuwa kutumia kupita kiasi huwasha ngozi ya ndani ya pua. Osha na kausha kila sehemu baada ya kila matumizi na usishirikishe kati ya watoto. Kupumua haraka, kifua kuingia ndani au mtoto asiyeweza kunyonya kunahitaji kliniki, si kuvuta kamasi. Afya Basics huuza kifaa rahisi, seti yenye chumvi na kifaa cha umeme kwa sababu pua zilizoziba ni mojawapo ya sababu za kawaida za wazazi kutafuta msaada wakati wa mvua."],["Seasonal must-have during the rains with a premium electric upgrade","Hitaji la msimu wa mvua lenye chaguo la hadhi la umeme"]],"mb_hlth_saline":[["Saline is sterile salt water that loosens thick mucus so it can be sneezed out or gently suctioned, and it is safe from birth with no medicine in it. Two to three drops in each nostril before feeds and sleep is usually enough; sprays and mists suit older children. A 10 ml bottle lasts one cold, and once opened it should be discarded after about a month and never shared. Medicated decongestant drops are not recommended for young children without medical advice. Afya stocks an affordable basic drop, a branded drop and a seawater spray because saline is the first, safest step for a child’s cold.","Chumvi ya pua ni maji ya chumvi safi yasiyo na vijidudu yanayolainisha kamasi nzito ili zitoke kwa kupiga chafya au kuvutwa kwa upole, na ni salama tangu kuzaliwa bila dawa ndani yake. Matone mawili hadi matatu katika kila tundu la pua kabla ya kunyonya na kulala kwa kawaida yanatosha; spray na ukungu hufaa watoto wakubwa. Chupa ya mililita 10 hutosha mafua mara moja, na ikishafunguliwa itupwe baada ya takriban mwezi mmoja na isishirikishwe. Matone ya dawa ya kuzibua pua hayashauriwi kwa watoto wadogo bila ushauri wa kitabibu. Afya Basics huuza matone ya msingi ya bei nafuu, matone yenye chapa na spray ya maji ya bahari kwa sababu chumvi ndiyo hatua ya kwanza na salama zaidi kwa mafua ya mtoto."],["Very low-cost, high-trust seasonal item that sells with aspirators","Bidhaa ya msimu ya bei ndogo sana yenye imani kubwa inayouzwa pamoja na vifaa vya kuvuta kamasi"]],"mb_hlth_ors":[["Diarrhoea remains one of the leading causes of death in Tanzanian children under five, and almost all of those deaths come from dehydration that ORS can prevent. Low-osmolarity ORS replaces the exact balance of water, salt and sugar lost in stools; mix one sachet in the stated volume of clean water, offer small sips after every loose stool and continue breastfeeding and food. Mixed ORS should be used within 24 hours. A household with young children should keep at least five sachets at home, more in the rainy season. Danger signs such as sunken eyes, no tears, very little urine, blood in the stool or a child too weak to drink need a clinic immediately. Afya stocks WHO-formula sachets at the lowest possible price because no home should be without them.","Kuharisha bado ni mojawapo ya sababu kuu za vifo vya watoto chini ya miaka mitano nchini Tanzania, na karibu vifo vyote hivyo hutokana na upungufu wa maji mwilini ambao ORS inaweza kuzuia. ORS ya kiwango cha chini cha chumvi hurudisha uwiano sahihi wa maji, chumvi na sukari uliopotea katika choo; changanya pakiti moja katika kiasi kilichoelezwa cha maji safi, mpe mtoto mafundo madogo baada ya kila choo cha majimaji na endelea kunyonyesha na kumlisha. ORS iliyochanganywa itumike ndani ya saa 24. Nyumba yenye watoto wadogo inapaswa kuwa na angalau pakiti tano, zaidi wakati wa mvua. Dalili za hatari kama macho kuingia ndani, kukosa machozi, kukojoa kidogo sana, damu kwenye choo au mtoto aliye dhaifu kushindwa kunywa zinahitaji kliniki mara moja. Afya Basics huuza pakiti za kiwango cha WHO kwa bei ya chini kabisa kwa sababu hakuna nyumba inayopaswa kukosa."],["Life-saving, very low-cost item that builds trust and peaks in the rains","Bidhaa ya kuokoa maisha ya bei ndogo sana inayojenga imani na kuuzwa zaidi wakati wa mvua"]],"mb_hlth_orsz":[["WHO and UNICEF recommend giving zinc for 10 to 14 days alongside ORS whenever a child has diarrhoea: it shortens the episode, reduces how severe it is and lowers the chance of another bout in the following months. The dose is 10 mg a day for babies under six months and 20 mg for older children, using dispersible tablets dissolved in a little breast milk or water. Combined packs contain the ORS sachets and the full zinc course, which makes it easy to complete. Keep one pack at home per young child, and still seek care for danger signs. Afya stocks co-packs and loose zinc because completing the full course is what protects the child.","WHO na UNICEF wanashauri kumpa mtoto zinki kwa siku 10 hadi 14 pamoja na ORS kila anapoharisha: hupunguza muda wa kuharisha, hupunguza ukali wake na hupunguza uwezekano wa kuharisha tena katika miezi inayofuata. Kipimo ni miligramu 10 kwa siku kwa watoto chini ya miezi sita na miligramu 20 kwa watoto wakubwa, kwa kutumia vidonge vinavyoyeyuka katika maziwa ya mama kidogo au maji. Vifurushi vya pamoja vina pakiti za ORS na dozi kamili ya zinki, hivyo ni rahisi kukamilisha. Weka kifurushi kimoja nyumbani kwa kila mtoto mdogo, na bado tafuta huduma kwa dalili za hatari. Afya Basics huuza vifurushi vya pamoja na zinki peke yake kwa sababu kukamilisha dozi yote ndiko kunakomlinda mtoto."],["Evidence-based treatment kit that differentiates Afya from ordinary shops","Kifaa cha tiba chenye ushahidi kinachoitofautisha Afya na maduka ya kawaida"]],"mb_hlth_para":[["Paracetamol suspension relieves fever and pain from teething, vaccinations and common infections, making a child more comfortable while the cause is treated. The dose depends on age and weight, so always use the syringe or spoon in the pack, give no more than four doses in 24 hours, and leave at least four hours between doses. In Tanzania a feverish child should still be tested for malaria, and fever in a baby under three months needs a clinic before any medicine. Choose sugar-free formulas where possible to protect teeth, and store out of reach of children. Afya stocks a low-cost local syrup, a trusted brand and a sugar-free infant formula so every family can keep a bottle at home.","Paracetamol ya maji hupunguza homa na maumivu yanayotokana na kuota meno, chanjo na maambukizi ya kawaida, na kumfanya mtoto ajisikie vizuri wakati chanzo kinatibiwa. Kipimo hutegemea umri na uzito, hivyo tumia daima sirinji au kijiko kilicho ndani ya pakiti, usitoe zaidi ya dozi nne kwa saa 24, na acha angalau saa nne kati ya dozi. Nchini Tanzania mtoto mwenye homa bado apimwe malaria, na homa kwa mtoto chini ya miezi mitatu inahitaji kliniki kabla ya dawa yoyote. Chagua zisizo na sukari inapowezekana ili kulinda meno, na hifadhi mbali na watoto. Afya Basics huuza sharubati ya bei nafuu ya karibu, chapa inayoaminika na aina ya watoto wachanga isiyo na sukari ili kila familia iwe na chupa nyumbani."],["Essential OTC medicine every family repurchases through childhood","Dawa muhimu isiyohitaji cheti inayonunuliwa tena na kila familia katika utoto wote"]],"mb_hlth_ibu":[["Ibuprofen relieves pain and fever and also reduces inflammation, so it is useful for teething, ear pain and sprains in children over three months. It should be given with food or milk, using the dosing syringe, no more than three times in 24 hours. Do not give it to a child who is dehydrated from vomiting or diarrhoea, has asthma that worsens with it, or has chickenpox, and do not alternate it with paracetamol unless advised by a health worker. Fever still needs a malaria test. A 200 ml bottle lasts a family many months. Afya stocks a trusted branded suspension as the second-line pain reliever for children, with clear guidance at the counter.","Ibuprofen hupunguza maumivu na homa na pia hupunguza uvimbe, hivyo husaidia kwa kuota meno, maumivu ya sikio na kuteguka kwa watoto wenye zaidi ya miezi mitatu. Itolewe pamoja na chakula au maziwa, kwa kutumia sirinji ya kipimo, si zaidi ya mara tatu kwa saa 24. Usimpe mtoto aliyepungukiwa maji mwilini kwa kutapika au kuharisha, mwenye pumu inayoongezeka kwa dawa hii, au mwenye tetekuwanga, na usibadilishane na paracetamol isipokuwa umeshauriwa na mhudumu wa afya. Homa bado inahitaji kipimo cha malaria. Chupa ya mililita 200 hudumu kwa familia miezi mingi. Afya Basics huuza dawa ya maji yenye chapa inayoaminika kama dawa ya pili ya maumivu kwa watoto, pamoja na maelekezo wazi kaunta."],["Pharmacy-led medicine with healthy margin that completes the fever shelf","Dawa ya famasia yenye faida nzuri inayokamilisha rafu ya homa"]],"mb_hlth_rub":[["Baby chest rubs are mild, menthol- and camphor-free balms made with a petrolatum base, aloe and light scents such as lavender and rosemary that can make a congested baby more comfortable and calm at bedtime. Adult vapour rubs contain camphor and menthol, which can cause breathing problems in young children and must not be used on babies. Rub a small amount on the chest, neck and back, never on the face, nose or broken skin, and keep the jar out of reach. A rub soothes but does not treat infection, so fast breathing or a baby who will not feed needs care. Afya stocks the baby-safe version so parents are not tempted to use the adult product.","Mafuta ya kifua ya watoto ni marashi laini yasiyo na menthol wala camphor, yenye msingi wa petrolatum, aloe na harufu hafifu kama lavenda na rozmarini vinavyoweza kumfanya mtoto aliyeziba pua ajisikie vizuri na kutulia wakati wa kulala. Mafuta ya kifua ya watu wazima yana camphor na menthol, ambavyo vinaweza kusababisha matatizo ya kupumua kwa watoto wadogo na havipaswi kutumika kwa watoto wachanga. Paka kiasi kidogo kifuani, shingoni na mgongoni, kamwe si usoni, puani wala kwenye ngozi iliyochubuka, na weka chupa mbali na watoto. Mafuta haya hutuliza lakini hayatibu maambukizi, hivyo kupumua haraka au mtoto asiyetaka kunyonya kunahitaji huduma. Afya Basics huuza aina salama kwa watoto ili wazazi wasishawishike kutumia bidhaa ya watu wazima."],["Seasonal cold-care item that steers families to the safe choice","Bidhaa ya msimu wa mafua inayoelekeza familia kwenye chaguo salama"]],"mb_hlth_water":[["Unsafe water spreads diarrhoea, typhoid and cholera, and babies starting complementary food at six months are especially exposed. Chlorine products such as liquid hypochlorite or tablets kill most germs: add the measured dose to clear water, stir and wait 30 minutes before drinking; cloudy water should be settled or filtered first. One 150 ml bottle treats about 1,000 litres, around two months for a family, while one tablet treats 20 litres. Water for mixing infant formula should still be boiled and cooled to at least 70 °C first, as WHO advises. Afya stocks liquid and tablet options because safe water is the base of every child’s health, especially in the rains.","Maji yasiyo salama hueneza kuharisha, homa ya matumbo na kipindupindu, na watoto wanaoanza chakula cha nyongeza katika miezi sita wako hatarini zaidi. Bidhaa za klorini kama hypochlorite ya maji au vidonge huua vijidudu vingi: weka kipimo kilichopimwa kwenye maji safi yasiyo na tope, koroga na subiri dakika 30 kabla ya kunywa; maji yenye tope yatulizwe au yachujwe kwanza. Chupa moja ya mililita 150 hutibu takriban lita 1,000, karibu miezi miwili kwa familia, na kidonge kimoja hutibu lita 20. Maji ya kuchanganya maziwa ya kopo bado yachemshwe na kupoa hadi angalau nyuzi 70 kwanza, kama WHO inavyoshauri. Afya Basics huuza aina za maji na vidonge kwa sababu maji salama ndiyo msingi wa afya ya kila mtoto, hasa wakati wa mvua."],["Very low-cost, high-impact item that surges in the rains and cholera alerts","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo sana yenye athari kubwa inayouzwa sana wakati wa mvua na tahadhari za kipindupindu"]],"mb_hlth_plaster":[["Toddlers learning to walk and run collect scrapes and small cuts daily, and a clean plaster keeps dirt out while the skin heals. Wash the wound with clean water, pat dry, and apply a plaster sized to cover it completely; change it daily or whenever wet. Waterproof plasters suit children who play outside, and colourful designs make children more willing to keep them on. Do not use plasters on babies under one year who might pull them off and swallow them, and see a health worker for deep cuts, animal bites or wounds that become red, hot or swollen. Afya stocks value, waterproof and character plasters because they belong in every family first-aid box.","Watoto wadogo wanaojifunza kutembea na kukimbia hupata michubuko na majeraha madogo kila siku, na plasta safi huzuia uchafu wakati ngozi inapona. Osha jeraha kwa maji safi, kausha kwa kugusa, na bandika plasta ya saizi inayolifunika lote; ibadilishe kila siku au inapolowa. Plasta zisizopitisha maji hufaa watoto wanaocheza nje, na michoro ya rangi huwafanya watoto wakubali kuziacha. Usitumie plasta kwa watoto chini ya mwaka mmoja ambao wanaweza kuzivuta na kuzimeza, na muone mhudumu wa afya kwa majeraha ya kina, kuumwa na wanyama au vidonda vinavyokuwa vyekundu, vya moto au kuvimba. Afya Basics huuza plasta za bei nafuu, zisizopitisha maji na zenye michoro kwa sababu ni sehemu ya kila sanduku la huduma ya kwanza la familia."],["Impulse-friendly, repeat first-aid item for active toddlers","Bidhaa ya huduma ya kwanza inayonunuliwa kwa haraka na kurudiwa kwa watoto wachangamfu"]],"mb_hlth_antis":[["Most small wounds heal well after thorough rinsing with clean running water, and an antiseptic adds protection where dirt is a concern, such as grazes from play outdoors. Liquid antiseptics must be diluted exactly as the label states before use on a child’s skin, because undiluted solutions can burn, while antiseptic creams are applied in a thin layer. Never use antiseptics on a baby’s cord stump unless advised by the clinic, and keep bottles locked away as they are poisonous if swallowed. A small bottle or tube lasts many months. Afya stocks liquid and cream options in child-friendly sizes for the family first-aid box.","Majeraha mengi madogo hupona vizuri baada ya kuoshwa vizuri kwa maji safi yanayotiririka, na dawa ya kuua vijidudu huongeza kinga pale uchafu unapokuwa tatizo, kama michubuko ya kucheza nje. Dawa za maji lazima zichanganywe na maji sawasawa na maelekezo kabla ya kutumika kwenye ngozi ya mtoto, kwa sababu dawa isiyochanganywa inaweza kuunguza, na krimu hupakwa kwa tabaka jembamba. Usitumie dawa hizi kwenye kitovu cha mtoto isipokuwa kliniki imeshauri, na hifadhi chupa mahali palipofungwa kwa kuwa ni sumu zikinywewa. Chupa ndogo au mrija hudumu miezi mingi. Afya Basics huuza aina za maji na krimu za saizi zinazofaa familia kwa ajili ya sanduku la huduma ya kwanza."],["Trusted household basic that completes the first-aid basket","Bidhaa ya msingi ya nyumbani inayoaminika inayokamilisha kikapu cha huduma ya kwanza"]],"mb_hlth_deworm":[["Intestinal worms are common in Tanzanian children and cause anaemia, poor growth and tiredness that affects learning. WHO recommends periodic deworming with a single dose of albendazole or mebendazole for children from 12 months in areas where worms are common, and Tanzania gives it through clinic and school campaigns every six months. For children aged one to two the dose is half a 400 mg tablet (200 mg), and from two years a full tablet, which can be crushed and mixed with a little water. Hand washing, wearing shoes and clean water stop reinfection. Pregnant women should only take it after the first trimester on clinic advice. Afya stocks value and branded albendazole so families can keep to the six-month schedule.","Minyoo ya tumbo ni ya kawaida kwa watoto wa Tanzania na husababisha upungufu wa damu, ukuaji duni na uchovu unaoathiri kujifunza. Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri dawa ya minyoo ya mara kwa mara kwa dozi moja ya albendazole au mebendazole kwa watoto kuanzia miezi 12 katika maeneo ambako minyoo ni ya kawaida, na Tanzania huitoa kupitia kampeni za kliniki na shule kila miezi sita. Kwa watoto wa mwaka mmoja hadi miwili kipimo ni nusu ya kidonge cha miligramu 400 (miligramu 200), na kuanzia miaka miwili kidonge kizima, ambacho kinaweza kusagwa na kuchanganywa na maji kidogo. Kunawa mikono, kuvaa viatu na maji safi huzuia kuambukizwa tena. Wajawazito wanywe tu baada ya miezi mitatu ya kwanza kwa ushauri wa kliniki. Afya Basics huuza albendazole ya bei nafuu na yenye chapa ili familia zifuate ratiba ya miezi sita."],["Twice-yearly reminder purchase ideal for Afya Box schedules","Ununuzi wa kukumbushwa mara mbili kwa mwaka unaofaa sana ratiba za Afya Box"]],"mb_nutr_f1":[["Breast milk is the best food for babies and WHO recommends exclusive breastfeeding for six months; infant formula is a medical-nutrition product for babies whose mothers cannot breastfeed or need to supplement. Stage 1 formula is the only suitable milk substitute in the first six months, and all registered brands meet the same international composition standard, so a lower-priced brand is as safe as a premium one. Powdered formula is not sterile: WHO advises mixing it with water boiled and cooled to at least 70 °C, measuring scoops exactly, and discarding any feed left after two hours. A baby fully fed on formula uses about four to five 400 g tins a month. Under the WHO International Code of Marketing of Breast-milk Substitutes and Tanzania’s regulations, Afya does not promote, discount or display this product, and sells it on a health worker’s advice.","Maziwa ya mama ndicho chakula bora zaidi kwa watoto na Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri kunyonyesha maziwa ya mama pekee kwa miezi sita; maziwa ya kopo ni bidhaa ya lishe ya kitabibu kwa watoto ambao mama zao hawawezi kunyonyesha au wanahitaji nyongeza. Maziwa ya kopo ya hatua ya 1 ndiyo mbadala pekee unaofaa katika miezi sita ya kwanza, na chapa zote zilizosajiliwa hukidhi kiwango kimoja cha kimataifa cha muundo, hivyo chapa ya bei nafuu ni salama kama ile ya hadhi. Unga wa maziwa ya kopo hauna usafi kamili: WHO inashauri kuuchanganya na maji yaliyochemshwa na kupoa hadi angalau nyuzi 70, kupima vijiko sawasawa, na kumwaga mabaki yoyote baada ya saa mbili. Mtoto anayelishwa maziwa ya kopo pekee hutumia takriban makopo manne hadi matano ya gramu 400 kwa mwezi. Kwa mujibu wa Kanuni ya Kimataifa ya WHO kuhusu Uuzaji wa Vibadala vya Maziwa ya Mama na kanuni za Tanzania, Afya Basics haitangazi, haipunguzi bei wala haionyeshi bidhaa hii, na huiuza kwa ushauri wa mhudumu wa afya."],["A necessary, responsibly sold product that families trust a health store to handle correctly","Bidhaa ya lazima inayouzwa kwa uwajibikaji ambayo familia huamini duka la afya kuishughulikia ipasavyo"]],"mb_nutr_f2":[["Follow-on formula is designed for babies from six months who are also eating family foods, with a little more iron than stage 1. WHO considers it unnecessary for babies who are breastfed or who can continue on their stage-1 formula, so it is a choice, not a requirement, and should never replace breastfeeding. From six months, porridges, mashed beans, eggs, fish and vegetables should provide an increasing share of the baby’s nutrition. Prepare with the same hygiene as stage 1 and use the scoop provided; a baby on two to three bottles a day uses about two 400 g tins a month. Under the WHO International Code of Marketing of Breast-milk Substitutes and Tanzania’s regulations, Afya does not promote, discount or display this product, and sells it on a health worker’s advice.","Maziwa ya kopo ya kuendelea yameundwa kwa watoto kuanzia miezi sita wanaokula pia vyakula vya familia, yakiwa na madini chuma kidogo zaidi kuliko hatua ya 1. Shirika la Afya Duniani linaona hayahitajiki kwa watoto wanaonyonya au wanaoweza kuendelea na maziwa ya hatua ya 1, hivyo ni chaguo na si lazima, na kamwe hayapaswi kuchukua nafasi ya kunyonyesha. Kuanzia miezi sita, uji, maharage yaliyopondwa, mayai, samaki na mboga vinapaswa kutoa sehemu inayoongezeka ya lishe ya mtoto. Andaa kwa usafi uleule wa hatua ya 1 na tumia kijiko kilichotolewa; mtoto anayekunywa chupa mbili hadi tatu kwa siku hutumia takriban makopo mawili ya gramu 400 kwa mwezi. Kwa mujibu wa Kanuni ya Kimataifa ya WHO kuhusu Uuzaji wa Vibadala vya Maziwa ya Mama na kanuni za Tanzania, Afya Basics haitangazi, haipunguzi bei wala haionyeshi bidhaa hii, na huiuza kwa ushauri wa mhudumu wa afya."],["Continuity purchase for formula-fed families, sold within Code rules","Ununuzi wa mwendelezo kwa familia zinazotumia maziwa ya kopo, unaouzwa ndani ya masharti ya Kanuni"]],"mb_nutr_gum":[["Growing-up or toddler milks are fortified milk powders for children aged one to three. WHO states they are not necessary: after the first birthday, continued breastfeeding up to two years and beyond, plus ordinary full-cream milk and a varied family diet, meet a toddler’s needs at lower cost. Some families still prefer them for picky eaters or convenience, so choose one without added sugar or honey and limit milk to about 350–500 ml a day so the child stays hungry for iron-rich foods. A 400 g tin lasts about a week to ten days at two cups a day. Under the WHO International Code of Marketing of Breast-milk Substitutes and Tanzania’s regulations, Afya does not promote, discount or display this product, and sells it on a health worker’s advice.","Maziwa ya ukuaji au ya watoto wadogo ni unga wa maziwa ulioongezwa virutubisho kwa watoto wa mwaka mmoja hadi mitatu. Shirika la Afya Duniani linaeleza kuwa hayahitajiki: baada ya siku ya kuzaliwa ya kwanza, kuendelea kunyonyesha hadi miaka miwili na zaidi, pamoja na maziwa ya kawaida ya mafuta kamili na mlo wa familia wenye aina mbalimbali, hukidhi mahitaji ya mtoto mdogo kwa gharama ndogo. Baadhi ya familia bado huyapendelea kwa watoto wanaochagua chakula au kwa urahisi, hivyo chagua yasiyoongezwa sukari wala asali na punguza maziwa hadi takriban mililita 350–500 kwa siku ili mtoto abaki na hamu ya vyakula vyenye madini chuma. Kopo la gramu 400 hudumu takriban wiki moja hadi siku kumi kwa vikombe viwili kwa siku. Kwa mujibu wa Kanuni ya Kimataifa ya WHO kuhusu Uuzaji wa Vibadala vya Maziwa ya Mama na kanuni za Tanzania, Afya Basics haitangazi, haipunguzi bei wala haionyeshi bidhaa hii, na huiuza kwa ushauri wa mhudumu wa afya."],["Sold honestly alongside cheaper alternatives, reinforcing Afya’s trusted-adviser role","Huuzwa kwa uaminifu pamoja na mbadala nafuu, na kuimarisha nafasi ya Afya kama mshauri anayeaminika"]],"mb_nutr_spec":[["Lactose-free and anti-reflux (thickened) formulas are made for specific feeding problems and should only be used when a doctor or clinical officer recommends them. Most babies who spit up are healthy “happy spitters” who need no special milk, and true lactose intolerance is rare in infants; diarrhoea usually needs ORS and continued feeding rather than a change of milk. Anti-reflux formulas thicken in the stomach and need precise mixing and a suitable teat. Using a special formula without need can hide a more serious illness, so a baby with poor weight gain, forceful vomiting or blood in the stool must be seen. Under the WHO International Code of Marketing of Breast-milk Substitutes and Tanzania’s regulations, Afya does not promote, discount or display this product, and sells it on a health worker’s advice.","Maziwa ya kopo yasiyo na lactose na ya kuzuia kucheua (yaliyozidishwa uzito) hutengenezwa kwa matatizo maalum ya ulishaji na yanapaswa kutumika tu daktari au tabibu anapoyashauri. Watoto wengi wanaocheua ni wazima wanaocheua tu bila tatizo na hawahitaji maziwa maalum, na kutovumilia lactose kwa kweli ni nadra kwa watoto wachanga; kuharisha kwa kawaida kunahitaji ORS na kuendelea kulisha badala ya kubadilisha maziwa. Maziwa ya kuzuia kucheua huwa mazito tumboni na yanahitaji kuchanganywa kwa usahihi na nyonyo inayofaa. Kutumia maziwa maalum bila hitaji kunaweza kuficha ugonjwa mkubwa zaidi, hivyo mtoto anayeongezeka uzito kidogo, anayetapika kwa nguvu au mwenye damu kwenye choo lazima aonwe na mhudumu wa afya. Kwa mujibu wa Kanuni ya Kimataifa ya WHO kuhusu Uuzaji wa Vibadala vya Maziwa ya Mama na kanuni za Tanzania, Afya Basics haitangazi, haipunguzi bei wala haionyeshi bidhaa hii, na huiuza kwa ushauri wa mhudumu wa afya."],["Specialist, prescription-led stock that brings referred families to Afya","Bidhaa ya kitaalamu inayotegemea ushauri wa daktari inayoleta familia zinazoelekezwa Afya"]],"mb_nutr_cer":[["Instant infant cereals are pre-cooked, iron-fortified flours that mix with breast milk or boiled water into a smooth porridge, convenient for busy mornings, travel and day care. They give a reliable dose of iron and zinc at the age when a baby’s stores run low. Start at six months with a thick consistency that stays on a spoon, not a runny drink, and progress to mashed family foods; choose plain flavours with little added sugar and never add the cereal to a bottle. A baby having one cereal meal a day uses a 350–400 g pack in about two weeks. Afya stocks Tanzanian and Kenyan packs of trusted cereals next to cheaper local flours so parents can mix both.","Nafaka za papo hapo za watoto wachanga ni unga uliopikwa tayari na kuongezwa madini chuma unaochanganywa na maziwa ya mama au maji yaliyochemshwa kuwa uji laini, rahisi kwa asubuhi zenye shughuli nyingi, safari na malezi ya mchana. Hutoa kiasi cha uhakika cha madini chuma na zinki katika umri ambao akiba ya mtoto hupungua. Anza katika miezi sita kwa uji mzito unaokaa kwenye kijiko, si kinywaji chepesi, na endelea hadi vyakula vya familia vilivyopondwa; chagua ladha za kawaida zenye sukari kidogo na usiweke nafaka kwenye chupa kamwe. Mtoto anayekula mlo mmoja wa nafaka kwa siku hutumia pakiti ya gramu 350–400 kwa takriban wiki mbili. Afya Basics huuza pakiti za Tanzania na Kenya za nafaka zinazoaminika kando ya unga wa karibu wa bei nafuu ili wazazi watumie vyote."],["Fast-moving weaning staple with brand pull and twice-monthly repeat","Bidhaa ya msingi ya kuanzisha chakula inayouzwa haraka, yenye mvuto wa chapa na kununuliwa mara mbili kwa mwezi"]],"mb_nutr_wean":[["Mixed-grain weaning flours combine maize, millet, sorghum, soya or groundnut so that a single porridge carries more protein and energy than plain maize. TDHS-MIS 2022 shows that about three in ten Tanzanian children under five are stunted, and thin, watery uji is one reason, so cook these flours thick, then enrich each bowl with a spoon of oil or groundnut paste, milk or mashed fruit. A baby eating two to three small bowls a day uses roughly 1 kg a month. Buy sealed packs, store in a dry tin and cook thoroughly; prepared porridge should be eaten the same day. Afya stocks affordable baby-specific mixes because they are the backbone of complementary feeding in most homes.","Unga wa nafaka mchanganyiko wa kuanzisha chakula huunganisha mahindi, ulezi, mtama, soya au karanga ili uji mmoja ubebe protini na nishati zaidi kuliko mahindi pekee. TDHS-MIS 2022 inaonyesha kuwa takriban watoto watatu kati ya kumi wa Tanzania walio chini ya miaka mitano wamedumaa, na uji mwepesi wenye maji mengi ni mojawapo ya sababu, hivyo pika unga huu mzito, kisha ongeza kila bakuli kijiko cha mafuta au siagi ya karanga, maziwa au tunda lililopondwa. Mtoto anayekula bakuli ndogo mbili hadi tatu kwa siku hutumia takriban kilo 1 kwa mwezi. Nunua pakiti zilizofungwa, hifadhi kwenye chombo kikavu na pika vizuri; uji uliopikwa uliwe siku hiyohiyo. Afya Basics huuza michanganyiko ya bei nafuu iliyoundwa kwa watoto kwa sababu ndiyo uti wa mgongo wa chakula cha nyongeza katika nyumba nyingi."],["Low-price, high-volume staple central to Afya’s nutrition mission","Bidhaa ya msingi ya bei nafuu na kiasi kikubwa iliyo kiini cha dhamira ya lishe ya Afya"]],"mb_nutr_uji":[["Ready-blended uji flours turn a breakfast porridge into a more nourishing meal with added grains, legumes or micronutrients, and fermented sour uji, a tradition across East Africa, is easier to digest and may be gentler on small stomachs. Once a child eats family foods, the same pot can serve everyone, which saves fuel and time. Cook thick, add milk or groundnut paste for energy, and limit sugar to a pinch. A family of four uses about 2 kg a month. Afya stocks popular fortified and fermented flours because uji is eaten daily in nearly every Tanzanian home.","Unga wa uji uliochanganywa tayari hugeuza uji wa asubuhi kuwa mlo wenye lishe zaidi kwa nafaka, jamii ya kunde au virutubisho vilivyoongezwa, na uji uliochachushwa, desturi ya Afrika Mashariki yote, ni rahisi kumeng’enywa na unaweza kuwa laini zaidi kwa matumbo madogo. Mtoto anapoanza kula vyakula vya familia, sufuria moja inaweza kuwahudumia wote, jambo linaookoa nishati na muda. Pika mzito, ongeza maziwa au siagi ya karanga kwa nishati, na punguza sukari kuwa kidogo sana. Familia ya watu wanne hutumia takriban kilo 2 kwa mwezi. Afya Basics huuza unga maarufu ulioongezwa virutubisho na uliochachushwa kwa sababu uji huliwa kila siku karibu katika kila nyumba ya Kitanzania."],["Everyday family staple that brings frequent, habitual visits","Bidhaa ya msingi ya familia ya kila siku inayoleta wateja mara kwa mara kwa mazoea"]],"mb_nutr_wimbi":[["Finger millet, called ulezi or wimbi, is one of the richest local grains in calcium and contains useful iron and fibre, which is why it has long been the grain of choice for baby and mothers’ uji in East Africa. Pure millet flour can be mixed with maize or soya flour for a smoother taste and higher protein. Roasting or fermenting improves digestibility and iron absorption, and adding a squeeze of orange or a vitamin-C-rich fruit to the meal helps further. A family using it daily for one child goes through about 1 kg every two to three weeks. Afya stocks pure and blended millet flours because they combine tradition, nutrition and a very affordable price.","Ulezi, unaoitwa pia wimbi, ni mojawapo ya nafaka za hapa nchini zenye kalsiamu nyingi zaidi na una madini chuma na nyuzinyuzi muhimu, ndiyo maana kwa muda mrefu umekuwa nafaka inayochaguliwa kwa uji wa watoto na wa akina mama Afrika Mashariki. Unga wa ulezi mtupu unaweza kuchanganywa na unga wa mahindi au soya kwa ladha laini zaidi na protini nyingi zaidi. Kukaanga au kuchachusha huboresha mmeng’enyo na ufyonzaji wa madini chuma, na kuongeza maji ya chungwa au tunda lenye vitamini C kwenye mlo husaidia zaidi. Familia inayoutumia kila siku kwa mtoto mmoja humaliza takriban kilo 1 kila wiki mbili hadi tatu. Afya Basics huuza unga wa ulezi mtupu na uliochanganywa kwa sababu huunganisha utamaduni, lishe na bei nafuu sana."],["Culturally loved, nutrient-dense grain that suits weekly Afya Box refills","Nafaka yenye virutubisho vingi inayopendwa kiutamaduni na inayofaa kujaza Afya Box kila wiki"]],"mb_nutr_maize":[["Tanzania’s food-fortification standards require industrially milled maize and wheat flours to contain added iron, zinc, folic acid and B vitamins, so choosing a fortified, factory-sealed brand quietly improves the micronutrient intake of the whole family, including young children who share ugali, chapati or uji. Look for the fortification mark and an intact seal, and store flour in a dry, covered container to prevent mould, which can produce harmful aflatoxins. A family of four uses 6–10 kg a month. Afya stocks fortified staples so that a mother’s weekly shop for the baby also covers the household.","Viwango vya urutubishaji wa chakula vya Tanzania vinataka unga wa mahindi na ngano unaosagwa viwandani uwe umeongezwa madini chuma, zinki, foliki asidi na vitamini B, hivyo kuchagua chapa iliyoongezwa virutubisho na kufungwa kiwandani huboresha kimya kimya virutubisho vya familia nzima, wakiwemo watoto wadogo wanaoshiriki ugali, chapati au uji. Tafuta alama ya urutubishaji na kifungashio kisichoharibika, na hifadhi unga kwenye chombo kikavu kilichofunikwa ili kuzuia ukungu, ambao unaweza kutoa sumu hatari ya aflatoxin. Familia ya watu wanne hutumia kilo 6–10 kwa mwezi. Afya Basics huuza vyakula hivi vya msingi vilivyoongezwa virutubisho ili ununuzi wa wiki wa mama kwa ajili ya mtoto uhudumie pia nyumba nzima."],["High-volume household staple that grows basket size and visit frequency","Bidhaa ya msingi ya nyumbani ya kiasi kikubwa inayoongeza ukubwa wa kikapu na mara za kutembelea"]],"mb_nutr_pb":[["A spoon of smooth groundnut paste stirred into uji adds energy, protein and healthy fat, exactly what thin porridges lack, and WHO advises introducing common allergens such as peanuts from six months rather than delaying them. Always use smooth paste thinned into food, never whole or chopped nuts or thick spoonfuls, which are choking hazards for under-fives. Choose pure groundnut paste without added sugar or palm oil, from a sealed jar, and store it covered because poorly stored groundnuts can carry aflatoxins. A 400 g jar lasts a family about two to three weeks. Afya stocks local brands at everyday prices as a simple, affordable way to make every bowl of uji more nourishing.","Kijiko cha siagi laini ya karanga kikikorogwa kwenye uji huongeza nishati, protini na mafuta yenye afya, hasa vitu ambavyo uji mwepesi hukosa, na Shirika la Afya Duniani linashauri kuanzisha vyakula vinavyosababisha mzio kama karanga kuanzia miezi sita badala ya kuchelewesha. Tumia daima siagi laini iliyochanganywa kwenye chakula, kamwe si karanga nzima, zilizokatwa au vijiko vizito, kwa kuwa ni hatari ya kusakamwa kwa watoto chini ya miaka mitano. Chagua siagi ya karanga tupu bila sukari wala mafuta ya mawese yaliyoongezwa, kutoka kwenye chupa iliyofungwa, na ihifadhi ikiwa imefunikwa kwa sababu karanga zilizohifadhiwa vibaya zinaweza kubeba sumu ya aflatoxin. Chupa ya gramu 400 hudumu kwa familia takriban wiki mbili hadi tatu. Afya Basics huuza chapa za hapa nchini kwa bei za kila siku kama njia rahisi na nafuu ya kuongeza lishe kwenye kila bakuli la uji."],["Affordable nutrition booster with frequent repeat and strong local brands","Kiongeza lishe cha bei nafuu kinachonunuliwa mara kwa mara chenye chapa imara za hapa nchini"]],"mb_nutr_milk":[["Milk is an excellent source of protein, calcium and energy for growing children, and powdered full-cream milk keeps for weeks without a fridge, which matters during power cuts. From 12 months it can be given as a drink or added to uji; before 12 months it may be used in cooked porridge but not as the main drink, and it is never a substitute for infant formula. Mix with boiled, cooled water as directed and use within the day. A toddler drinking two cups a day uses about 400 g in ten days to two weeks. Afya stocks popular fortified brands at fair prices because many families rely on powdered milk.","Maziwa ni chanzo bora cha protini, kalsiamu na nishati kwa watoto wanaokua, na unga wa maziwa ya mafuta kamili hukaa kwa wiki bila friji, jambo muhimu umeme unapokatika. Kuanzia miezi 12 yanaweza kutolewa kama kinywaji au kuongezwa kwenye uji; kabla ya miezi 12 yanaweza kutumika kwenye uji uliopikwa lakini si kama kinywaji kikuu, na kamwe si mbadala wa maziwa ya kopo ya watoto wachanga. Changanya na maji yaliyochemshwa na kupoa kama ilivyoelekezwa na tumia ndani ya siku hiyo. Mtoto mdogo anayekunywa vikombe viwili kwa siku hutumia takriban gramu 400 kwa siku kumi hadi wiki mbili. Afya Basics huuza chapa maarufu zilizoongezwa virutubisho kwa bei za haki kwa sababu familia nyingi hutegemea unga wa maziwa."],["High-frequency family purchase that also serves the toddler","Ununuzi wa familia wa mara kwa mara unaomhudumia pia mtoto mdogo"]],"mb_nutr_pouch":[["Ready-made fruit and oat pouches contain puréed fruit or vegetables with no added sugar and are sealed, so they are safe and practical for travel when fresh food is hard to prepare. They should be an occasional convenience, not a daily replacement for fresh mashed fruit and homemade foods, which cost far less and teach chewing. Squeeze the contents onto a spoon rather than letting a child suck from the spout, which can harm teeth and skip the chewing stage. Once opened, refrigerate and use within 24 hours. Afya stocks a small range for parents who want a healthy option on the go.","Mifuko ya matunda na shayiri iliyo tayari ina matunda au mboga zilizosagwa bila sukari iliyoongezwa na imefungwa, hivyo ni salama na rahisi kwa safari pale chakula freshi kinapokuwa vigumu kuandaa. Inapaswa kuwa urahisi wa mara kwa mara, si mbadala wa kila siku wa matunda freshi yaliyopondwa na vyakula vya nyumbani, ambavyo hugharimu kidogo sana na hufundisha kutafuna. Minya yaliyomo kwenye kijiko badala ya kumwacha mtoto anyonye kutoka mdomoni mwa mfuko, jambo linaloweza kuharibu meno na kuruka hatua ya kutafuna. Ikishafunguliwa, weka kwenye friji na tumia ndani ya saa 24. Afya Basics huuza bidhaa chache za aina hii kwa wazazi wanaotaka chaguo lenye afya wakiwa safarini."],["Premium convenience line with strong margin for travel and gifting","Bidhaa ya urahisi ya hadhi yenye faida nzuri kwa safari na zawadi"]],"mb_nutr_legume":[["Beans, lentils and split green grams (choroko) are the most affordable source of protein, iron and zinc for babies whose families cannot buy meat or fish every day, and WHO’s complementary-feeding guidance urges legumes daily. Split choroko cook quickly and mash smoothly; whole beans should be soaked overnight, cooked until very soft and the skins removed or sieved for young babies. Serve with a vitamin-C-rich fruit or tomato to improve iron absorption, and add a little oil for energy. A baby uses only two to three tablespoons a meal, so a 1 kg pack lasts a family weeks. Afya stocks clean, sorted packs so that a protein meal for the baby is always within reach.","Maharage, dengu na choroko ndio chanzo cha bei nafuu zaidi cha protini, madini chuma na zinki kwa watoto ambao familia zao haziwezi kununua nyama au samaki kila siku, na mwongozo wa WHO wa chakula cha nyongeza unahimiza jamii ya kunde kila siku. Choroko zilizopasuliwa huiva haraka na kupondeka laini; maharage mazima yalowekwe usiku kucha, yapikwe hadi yawe laini sana na maganda yaondolewe au kuchujwa kwa watoto wadogo. Pakua pamoja na tunda lenye vitamini C au nyanya ili kuongeza ufyonzaji wa madini chuma, na ongeza mafuta kidogo kwa nishati. Mtoto hutumia vijiko vikubwa viwili hadi vitatu tu kwa mlo, hivyo pakiti ya kilo 1 hudumu kwa familia wiki kadhaa. Afya Basics huuza pakiti safi zilizochambuliwa ili mlo wa protini wa mtoto upatikane daima."],["Affordable protein staple that supports the nutrition message and family baskets","Bidhaa ya msingi ya protini ya bei nafuu inayounga mkono ujumbe wa lishe na vikapu vya familia"]],"mb_nutr_oil":[["Babies have small stomachs but high energy needs, and adding about half to one teaspoon of oil to each bowl of porridge or mash is one of the simplest ways, recommended in Tanzanian nutrition counselling, to make a meal more energy-dense without making it bigger. Sunflower oil is light in taste and rich in vitamin E, and many brands are fortified with vitamin A under national standards. Use fresh oil once rather than reusing frying oil, and store it in a cool, dark place. A 1 L bottle used this way lasts a baby several months, alongside family cooking. Afya stocks two trusted brands so that this small habit is easy to follow.","Watoto wana matumbo madogo lakini mahitaji makubwa ya nishati, na kuongeza takriban nusu hadi kijiko kimoja kidogo cha mafuta kwenye kila bakuli la uji au chakula kilichopondwa ni mojawapo ya njia rahisi zaidi, zinazoshauriwa katika ushauri wa lishe nchini Tanzania, za kuongeza nishati ya mlo bila kuuongeza ukubwa. Mafuta ya alizeti yana ladha nyepesi na vitamini E nyingi, na chapa nyingi huongezwa vitamini A kwa mujibu wa viwango vya kitaifa. Tumia mafuta mapya mara moja badala ya kutumia tena mafuta ya kukaangia, na yahifadhi mahali penye ubaridi na giza. Chupa ya lita 1 ikitumika hivi hudumu kwa mtoto miezi kadhaa, pamoja na mapishi ya familia. Afya Basics huuza chapa mbili zinazoaminika ili desturi hii ndogo iwe rahisi kufuata."],["Everyday household staple that reinforces a key nutrition tip","Bidhaa ya msingi ya nyumbani ya kila siku inayoimarisha ushauri muhimu wa lishe"]],"mb_tod_potty":[["Most children are ready for toilet training between 18 months and three years, when they stay dry for two hours, notice when they are wet and can follow simple instructions. A potty placed on the floor lets a child sit with feet flat, which helps relaxation and bowel emptying, and gives independence. Choose a stable, wide base that does not tip, a splash guard for boys and a removable bowl that is easy to empty and disinfect. Introduce it calmly, praise success and never punish accidents; most children take a few weeks to a few months. Afya stocks a value potty and premium multi-stage designs because every toddler needs one and many families buy a second for grandma’s house.","Watoto wengi huwa tayari kufundishwa choo kati ya miezi 18 na miaka mitatu, wanapobaki wakavu kwa saa mbili, wanapotambua wamelowa na wanapoweza kufuata maelekezo rahisi. Poti iliyowekwa sakafuni humwezesha mtoto kuketi miguu ikiwa bapa sakafuni, jambo linalosaidia kutulia na kutoa choo kikamilifu, na humpa uhuru. Chagua kitako imara kipana kisichopinduka, kizuizi cha kuruka mkojo kwa wavulana na bakuli linalotolewa ambalo ni rahisi kumwaga na kusafisha kwa dawa. Ianzishe kwa utulivu, sifu mafanikio na kamwe usiadhibu makosa; watoto wengi huchukua wiki chache hadi miezi michache. Afya Basics huuza poti ya bei nafuu na za hadhi za hatua kadhaa kwa sababu kila mtoto mdogo anahitaji moja na familia nyingi hununua ya pili kwa nyumba ya bibi."],["Universal toddler milestone purchase with value-to-premium range","Ununuzi wa hatua muhimu kwa kila mtoto mdogo wenye bei kuanzia nafuu hadi hadhi"]],"mb_tod_seat":[["A trainer seat fits inside the adult toilet ring so a small child sits securely without fear of slipping in, and a step stool lets them climb up and rest their feet, which makes passing stools easier. Together they help children who refuse the potty or families with little space. Choose a seat with a non-slip rim, handles and a shape that suits both round and oval toilets, and a stool with rubber feet that will not slide on wet tiles. Wipe and disinfect daily. Afya stocks trainer seats and step stools because they complete the toilet-training journey and also teach handwashing at the sink.","Kiti cha kufundishia hukaa ndani ya kiti cha choo cha watu wazima ili mtoto mdogo aketi salama bila hofu ya kuteleza ndani, na kigoda cha kupandia humwezesha kupanda na kuweka miguu, jambo linalorahisisha kutoa choo. Kwa pamoja huwasaidia watoto wanaokataa poti au familia zenye nafasi ndogo. Chagua kiti chenye ukingo usioteleza, vishikio na umbo linalofaa vyoo vya mviringo na vya yai, na kigoda chenye miguu ya mpira kisichoteleza kwenye vigae vilivyolowa. Futa na safisha kwa dawa kila siku. Afya Basics huuza viti vya kufundishia na vigoda kwa sababu hukamilisha safari ya kufundisha choo na pia hufundisha kunawa mikono kwenye sinki."],["Natural follow-on to the potty with good margin","Ununuzi wa asili unaofuata poti wenye faida nzuri"]],"mb_tod_nightpants":[["Staying dry at night comes later than daytime control, and around one in seven five-year-olds still wets the bed; it is usually a matter of development, not laziness. Absorbent night pants that look like underwear protect sheets and the child’s confidence at sleepovers, boarding school or on journeys. Choose by weight and age band, and limit drinks in the hour before bed, with a toilet visit last thing. Bedwetting that starts again after six months dry, or comes with pain, thirst or daytime accidents, should be checked by a health worker. Afya stocks age-specific pants because parents value a discreet, understanding place to buy them.","Kubaki mkavu usiku huja baadaye kuliko kudhibiti mchana, na takriban mtoto mmoja kati ya saba wa miaka mitano bado hukojoa kitandani; kwa kawaida ni suala la ukuaji, si uvivu. Chupi za usiku zinazonyonya mkojo zinazofanana na chupi za kawaida hulinda mashuka na kujiamini kwa mtoto anapolala kwa wengine, shule ya bweni au safarini. Chagua kwa uzito na kundi la umri, na punguza vinywaji saa moja kabla ya kulala, pamoja na kwenda chooni mwisho kabisa. Kukojoa kitandani kunakoanza tena baada ya miezi sita ya ukavu, au kunakoambatana na maumivu, kiu au kujikojolea mchana, kuchunguzwe na mhudumu wa afya. Afya Basics huuza chupi za umri maalum kwa sababu wazazi huthamini mahali pa siri na penye uelewa pa kuzinunua."],["Discreet, recurring niche that few shops handle sensitively","Bidhaa ya siri ya kurudia ambayo maduka machache huishughulikia kwa uelewa"]],"mb_tod_tb":[["Tooth decay is common in Tanzanian children and starts as soon as teeth appear, especially with sugary drinks and night-time bottles. Brushing twice a day from the first tooth, with a brush that has a small head, very soft bristles and a chunky handle the parent can hold, is the best protection. Stage-specific brushes match the mouth size from 0–2, 3–5 and 6+ years, and training brushes help babies get used to the feeling. Replace the brush every three months or when bristles splay, and supervise brushing until about seven years. Afya stocks value, mid and premium children’s brushes because oral health is part of every child’s routine.","Kuoza kwa meno ni kawaida kwa watoto wa Tanzania na huanza mara tu meno yanapoota, hasa kwa vinywaji vitamu na chupa za usiku. Kupiga mswaki mara mbili kwa siku tangu jino la kwanza, kwa mswaki wenye kichwa kidogo, manyoya laini sana na mpini mnene ambao mzazi anaweza kushika, ndiyo kinga bora. Miswaki ya hatua maalum hulingana na ukubwa wa kinywa kwa umri wa miaka 0–2, 3–5 na 6 kuendelea, na miswaki ya kujifunzia huwasaidia watoto kuzoea hisia hiyo. Badilisha mswaki kila miezi mitatu au manyoya yanapotawanyika, na simamia kupiga mswaki hadi takriban miaka saba. Afya Basics huuza miswaki ya watoto ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi kwa sababu afya ya kinywa ni sehemu ya utaratibu wa kila mtoto."],["Cheap, quarterly repeat item that sells with toothpaste","Bidhaa ya bei nafuu ya kununuliwa kila robo mwaka inayouzwa pamoja na dawa ya meno"]],"mb_tod_tp":[["Fluoride toothpaste is the most effective everyday protection against tooth decay. International guidance is to use a smear the size of a grain of rice from the first tooth to three years and a pea-sized amount from three to six years, with toothpaste containing about 1,000 ppm fluoride or more as advised by the dentist. Children should spit out but not rinse, so the fluoride stays on the teeth, and adults should keep the tube out of reach because swallowing large amounts is harmful. A 50 ml tube lasts two to three months for one child. Afya stocks a popular kids’ paste and a premium age-banded brand so parents can pick the right strength.","Dawa ya meno yenye floraidi ndiyo kinga bora zaidi ya kila siku dhidi ya kuoza kwa meno. Mwongozo wa kimataifa ni kutumia kiasi kidogo kama punje ya mchele tangu jino la kwanza hadi miaka mitatu na kiasi cha punje ya njegere kuanzia miaka mitatu hadi sita, kwa dawa yenye takriban ppm 1,000 za floraidi au zaidi kama daktari wa meno anavyoshauri. Watoto watoe mate lakini wasisukutue, ili floraidi ibaki kwenye meno, na watu wazima waweke mrija mbali na watoto kwa sababu kumeza kiasi kikubwa ni hatari. Mrija wa mililita 50 hudumu miezi miwili hadi mitatu kwa mtoto mmoja. Afya Basics huuza dawa ya meno maarufu ya watoto na chapa ya hadhi iliyopangwa kwa umri ili wazazi wachague nguvu sahihi."],["Repeat personal-care item that pairs with brushes for school bundles","Bidhaa ya usafi ya kurudia inayoendana na miswaki kwa vifurushi vya shule"]],"mb_tod_teeth":[["Teething usually begins between four and seven months and can make babies dribble, chew everything and sleep poorly, but it does not cause high fever or diarrhoea, so those symptoms need checking. Firm silicone or natural-wood teethers give the gums something safe to bite, and water-filled teethers can be cooled in the fridge (not the freezer) for extra relief. Choose one-piece designs with no small parts, check daily for splits and wash after use. Avoid amber necklaces and teething gels containing local anaesthetics, which are not recommended for babies. Afya stocks teethers at several prices because they are inexpensive, needed by every baby and a favourite small gift.","Kuota meno kwa kawaida huanza kati ya miezi minne na saba na kunaweza kumfanya mtoto atoe udenda, atafune kila kitu na alale vibaya, lakini hakusababishi homa kali wala kuharisha, hivyo dalili hizo zinahitaji kuchunguzwa. Vitu vya kutafuna vya silikoni imara au mbao asilia hupa fizi kitu salama cha kuuma, na vyenye maji ndani vinaweza kupozwa kwenye friji (si jokofu la kugandisha) kwa nafuu zaidi. Chagua vya kipande kimoja bila sehemu ndogo, kagua kila siku kama vimepasuka na osha baada ya kutumia. Epuka mikufu ya kaharabu na jeli za meno zenye dawa za ganzi, ambazo hazishauriwi kwa watoto. Afya Basics huuza vitu hivi vya bei mbalimbali kwa sababu ni nafuu, kila mtoto anavihitaji na ni zawadi ndogo inayopendwa."],["Low-cost, high-turnover impulse item with safety advice built in","Bidhaa ya bei nafuu inayouzwa haraka kwa haraka yenye ushauri wa usalama ndani yake"]],"mb_tod_bottle":[["In Dar es Salaam’s heat children need to drink regularly, and their own labelled bottle of safe water at nursery or school prevents dehydration and reduces sharing of cups that spreads infections. Choose a BPA-free bottle of 500–700 ml with a leak-proof lid a small child can open, a carry loop and parts that come apart for cleaning. Fill with treated or boiled water, not juice, wash daily with hot soapy water and dry with the lid off to prevent mould. A good bottle lasts a school year or more. Afya stocks value and premium bottles because they peak at every school-term start.","Katika joto la Dar es Salaam watoto wanahitaji kunywa maji mara kwa mara, na chupa yao yenye jina ya maji salama shuleni au shule ya awali huzuia upungufu wa maji mwilini na hupunguza kushirikiana vikombe kunakoeneza maambukizi. Chagua chupa isiyo na BPA ya mililita 500–700 yenye mfuniko usiovuja ambao mtoto mdogo anaweza kufungua, kitanzi cha kubebea na sehemu zinazofunguliwa kwa kusafisha. Jaza maji yaliyotibiwa au kuchemshwa, si juisi, osha kila siku kwa maji ya moto yenye sabuni na kausha mfuniko ukiwa wazi ili kuzuia ukungu. Chupa nzuri hudumu mwaka wa shule au zaidi. Afya Basics huuza chupa za bei nafuu na za hadhi kwa sababu mauzo hupanda kila mwanzo wa muhula wa shule."],["Strong school-season seller that links to water-treatment products","Bidhaa inayouzwa sana msimu wa shule inayounganishwa na dawa za kutibu maji"]],"mb_tod_book":[["Talking, singing and looking at pictures with a baby every day builds language and brain development long before the child can speak, and WHO’s Nurturing Care Framework highlights early learning as a pillar of child health. Newborns see bold black-and-white shapes best, so high-contrast cards suit the first months, while soft cloth books with crinkly pages can be chewed and washed safely. Picture flash cards help toddlers name everyday objects in Kiswahili and English. Choose sturdy, non-toxic materials with no loose parts, and read together for a few minutes daily. Afya stocks affordable early-learning items because development is part of health and they make meaningful gifts.","Kuzungumza, kuimba na kutazama picha pamoja na mtoto kila siku hujenga lugha na ukuaji wa ubongo muda mrefu kabla mtoto hajaanza kuongea, na Mfumo wa WHO wa Malezi Yenye Kujali unaonyesha kujifunza mapema kama nguzo ya afya ya mtoto. Watoto wachanga huona vizuri zaidi maumbo makubwa ya rangi nyeusi na nyeupe, hivyo kadi zenye rangi tofauti kali hufaa miezi ya mwanzo, na vitabu laini vya kitambaa vyenye kurasa zinazotoa sauti vinaweza kutafunwa na kufuliwa kwa usalama. Kadi za picha huwasaidia watoto wadogo kutaja vitu vya kila siku kwa Kiswahili na Kiingereza. Chagua vifaa imara visivyo na sumu bila sehemu zinazotoka, na someni pamoja kwa dakika chache kila siku. Afya Basics huuza vifaa vya kujifunzia vya bei nafuu kwa sababu ukuaji ni sehemu ya afya na ni zawadi zenye maana."],["Affordable development items that extend Afya’s nurturing-care message","Vifaa vya ukuaji vya bei nafuu vinavyopanua ujumbe wa Afya wa malezi yenye kujali"]],"mb_tod_rattle":[["Rattles and soft sensory toys encourage babies to reach, grasp, pass objects between hands and follow sounds, early motor and hearing skills that health workers check at clinic visits. Choose lightweight toys a small hand can hold, larger than 4.5 cm so they cannot be swallowed, with no detachable parts, and made of washable, non-toxic materials. Wrist rattles suit young babies who cannot yet grip. Wash regularly, because everything goes into the mouth, and check seams for damage. Afya stocks a range from simple rattles to plush sets because they are the most popular small gift for a new baby.","Njuga na vichezeo laini vya hisia huwahimiza watoto kufikia, kushika, kuhamisha vitu kati ya mikono na kufuatilia sauti, ujuzi wa awali wa mwili na usikivu ambao wahudumu wa afya huukagua wakati wa kliniki. Chagua vichezeo vyepesi ambavyo mkono mdogo unaweza kushika, vikubwa kuliko sentimita 4.5 ili visimezwe, bila sehemu zinazotoka, na vya vifaa vinavyofuliwa visivyo na sumu. Njuga za kifundo cha mkono hufaa watoto wadogo ambao bado hawawezi kushika. Osha mara kwa mara, kwa sababu kila kitu huingia mdomoni, na kagua mishono kama imeharibika. Afya Basics huuza aina kuanzia njuga rahisi hadi seti laini kwa sababu ndizo zawadi ndogo zinazopendwa zaidi kwa mtoto mchanga."],["Top small gift with impulse appeal at the till","Zawadi ndogo inayoongoza yenye mvuto wa kununuliwa haraka kaunta"]],"mb_tod_puzzle":[["Chunky puzzles and shape sorters build hand–eye coordination, problem solving and early number and shape concepts, and they reward patience with a satisfying finish. Choose pieces large enough not to fit in a toilet-roll tube, made from smooth, splinter-free wood or sturdy plastic with non-toxic paint. Start with knob or single-shape puzzles from about one year and progress to multi-piece and stacking challenges. Play alongside the child and name colours and shapes in both languages. Afya stocks wooden and branded puzzles at three price levels because they are durable, educational gifts that parents feel good about.","Mafumbo makubwa na vichezeo vya kupanga maumbo hujenga uratibu wa mkono na jicho, utatuzi wa matatizo na dhana za awali za namba na maumbo, na hutuza uvumilivu kwa kumaliza kwa furaha. Chagua vipande vikubwa kiasi cha kutoingia kwenye mrija wa karatasi ya chooni, vya mbao laini isiyo na vibanzi au plastiki imara yenye rangi isiyo na sumu. Anza na mafumbo yenye vishikio au umbo moja kuanzia takriban mwaka mmoja na endelea hadi mafumbo ya vipande vingi na ya kupanga. Cheza pamoja na mtoto na taja rangi na maumbo kwa lugha zote mbili. Afya Basics huuza mafumbo ya mbao na yenye chapa katika viwango vitatu vya bei kwa sababu ni zawadi imara za kielimu ambazo wazazi huridhika nazo."],["Educational gift line with year-round and festive demand","Bidhaa za zawadi za kielimu zenye mahitaji mwaka mzima na wakati wa sikukuu"]],"mb_tod_blocks":[["Building blocks and stacking toys are among the most valuable toys a child can own: stacking, sorting and building strengthen fine motor skills, spatial thinking, imagination and the ability to play with others. Large interlocking bricks suit toddlers, and the same set grows with the child for years. Choose pieces too big to swallow, sturdy enough to step on and easy to wash, with a storage tub. Sit with the child to build, count and tell stories with the pieces. Afya stocks value block sets, stacking buckets and premium branded sets because they are long-lasting gifts for birthdays and the December holidays.","Vipande vya kujenga na vichezeo vya kupanga juu ni miongoni mwa vichezeo vyenye thamani zaidi ambavyo mtoto anaweza kuwa navyo: kupanga juu, kuchambua na kujenga huimarisha ujuzi wa vidole, kufikiri kuhusu nafasi, ubunifu na uwezo wa kucheza na wengine. Matofali makubwa yanayoungana hufaa watoto wadogo, na seti ileile hukua pamoja na mtoto kwa miaka. Chagua vipande vikubwa kiasi cha kutomezwa, imara kiasi cha kukanyagwa na rahisi kuosha, pamoja na chombo cha kuhifadhia. Kaa na mtoto kujenga, kuhesabu na kusimulia hadithi kwa vipande hivyo. Afya Basics huuza seti za vipande za bei nafuu, ndoo za kupanga na seti za chapa za hadhi kwa sababu ni zawadi zinazodumu kwa siku za kuzaliwa na likizo za Desemba."],["High-ticket festive gift line that extends Afya into play","Bidhaa za zawadi za sikukuu zenye thamani kubwa zinazopanua Afya kwenye michezo"]],"mb_sleep_cotnet":[["Babies nap through the afternoon and evening when mosquitoes are active, and a fitted cot net or pop-up net tent keeps them protected wherever they sleep. Most cot-size nets are untreated, so they are a barrier rather than an insecticide; where possible the baby should sleep under the family’s treated net, and the cot net is used for daytime naps, visits and travel. Choose fine mesh with no gaps at the base, a frame that keeps the net away from the baby’s face, and no loose cords. Check daily for holes and tuck the edges firmly. Afya stocks frame and pop-up nets because they solve a real gap for babies who sleep apart from their mothers.","Watoto hulala mchana na jioni wakati mbu wanapokuwa hai, na chandarua kinachokaa vizuri kwenye kitanda cha mtoto au hema la chandarua linalojifungua humlinda popote anapolala. Vyandarua vingi vya saizi ya kitanda cha mtoto havina dawa, hivyo ni kizuizi tu na si dawa ya kuua mbu; inapowezekana mtoto alale chini ya chandarua cha familia chenye dawa, na chandarua cha kitanda cha mtoto kitumike kwa usingizi wa mchana, matembezi na safari. Chagua neti yenye matundu madogo isiyo na mianya chini, fremu inayoweka neti mbali na uso wa mtoto, na isiyo na kamba zinazoning’inia. Kagua kila siku kama kuna matundu na kunja kingo kwa uthabiti. Afya Basics huuza vyandarua vya fremu na vinavyojifungua kwa sababu hujaza pengo halisi kwa watoto wanaolala mbali na mama zao."],["Malaria-season essential with affordable, giftable designs","Hitaji la msimu wa malaria lenye miundo nafuu inayofaa zawadi"]],"mb_sleep_protector":[["Safe sleep guidance from AAP and the Lullaby Trust calls for a firm, flat, clean mattress with nothing soft on top, and a fitted waterproof protector keeps that mattress dry and hygienic despite nappy leaks and spit-ups. Choose a breathable, quiet protector with a cotton top and fitted elastic corners so it stays taut and cannot ruck up around the baby. Have two, so one can be washed and sun-dried while the other is in use. Never add pillows, duvets, bumpers or soft toys in the cot under one year. Afya stocks a quality protector because it extends the life of a costly mattress and supports safe-sleep practice.","Mwongozo wa usingizi salama kutoka AAP na Lullaby Trust unataka godoro imara, bapa na safi bila kitu laini juu yake, na kifuniko kisichopitisha maji kinachokaa vizuri huweka godoro hilo kavu na safi licha ya nepi kuvuja na kucheua. Chagua kifuniko kinachopitisha hewa, kisicho na kelele, chenye juu ya pamba na pembe za mpira zinazokaa vizuri ili kibaki kimekazwa na kisijikunje karibu na mtoto. Kuwa na viwili, kimoja kifuliwe na kukaushwa juani huku kingine kikitumika. Kamwe usiweke mito, mablanketi mazito, mito ya pembeni au vichezeo laini kwenye kitanda cha mtoto chini ya mwaka mmoja. Afya Basics huuza kifuniko bora kwa sababu huongeza muda wa kudumu wa godoro la gharama na kusaidia desturi ya usingizi salama."],["Practical, safe-sleep-aligned item with good margin","Bidhaa ya vitendo inayoendana na usingizi salama yenye faida nzuri"]],"mb_sleep_night":[["A soft night light lets a parent feed, check or change a baby without switching on bright lights that fully wake the baby and disturb the circadian rhythm. It also prevents falls for a mother recovering from birth and for toddlers walking to the toilet at night. Warm, dim, amber-toned light is best; motion-sensor bulbs switch on only when someone moves, saving power. Place plug-in lights out of a child’s reach and never cover them with fabric. Afya stocks a motion-sensor bulb and a socket adaptor with a built-in light because they are inexpensive comforts for every nursery.","Taa laini ya usiku humwezesha mzazi kunyonyesha, kumwangalia au kumbadilisha mtoto bila kuwasha taa kali zinazomwamsha kabisa na kuvuruga mzunguko wake wa usingizi. Pia huzuia kuanguka kwa mama anayepona baada ya kujifungua na kwa watoto wadogo wanaokwenda chooni usiku. Mwanga hafifu, wa joto na wa rangi ya kaharabu ni bora zaidi; balbu zenye kihisi cha mwendo huwaka tu mtu anapopita, hivyo huokoa umeme. Weka taa za kuchomeka mbali na mtoto na kamwe usizifunike kwa kitambaa. Afya Basics huuza balbu yenye kihisi cha mwendo na kichomeo chenye taa ndani kwa sababu ni starehe nafuu kwa kila chumba cha mtoto."],["Inexpensive nursery add-on that also serves mothers and seniors","Nyongeza nafuu ya chumba cha mtoto inayowahudumia pia akina mama na wazee"]],"mb_sleep_socket":[["Crawling babies explore at floor level and are drawn to the holes of electrical sockets, where pushing in a key, pin or finger can cause a serious shock or burn. Socket inserts block unused outlets and are one of the cheapest, simplest home-safety steps. Choose inserts that fit Tanzania’s three-pin sockets firmly and need an adult’s grip to remove, and fit them to every low socket before the baby starts crawling at around six to nine months. Also keep cables and extension leads out of reach. Afya stocks socket covers as part of a home-proofing range that shows parents it cares about injury prevention, not just illness.","Watoto wanaotambaa huchunguza vitu vilivyo sakafuni na huvutiwa na matundu ya soketi za umeme, ambapo kuingiza ufunguo, pini au kidole kunaweza kusababisha shoti kali au kuungua. Vifuniko vya soketi huziba soketi zisizotumika na ni mojawapo ya hatua rahisi na nafuu zaidi za usalama nyumbani. Chagua vifuniko vinavyokaa imara kwenye soketi za pini tatu za Tanzania na vinavyohitaji nguvu ya mtu mzima kuvitoa, na viweke kwenye kila soketi iliyo chini kabla mtoto hajaanza kutambaa karibu miezi sita hadi tisa. Pia weka nyaya na vichomeo vya kurefusha mbali na mtoto. Afya Basics huuza vifuniko hivi kama sehemu ya bidhaa za kulinda nyumba zinazoonyesha wazazi kuwa inajali kuzuia ajali, si magonjwa pekee."],["Low-cost safety add-on that builds a home-proofing basket","Nyongeza ya usalama ya bei nafuu inayojenga kikapu cha kulinda nyumba"]],"mb_sleep_corner":[["Toddlers learning to walk fall often, and the sharp corners of coffee tables, TV stands and glass tables are at exactly the height of their heads and eyes. Soft corner guards stick onto these edges and cushion bumps that could otherwise cut or bruise. Choose thick, soft foam or silicone guards with strong adhesive, clean the surface before fitting, and check monthly that none have loosened, since a loose guard is a choking risk. Combine with anchoring tall furniture and TVs to the wall to prevent tip-overs. Afya stocks soft guards as an inexpensive part of its home-safety range.","Watoto wadogo wanaojifunza kutembea huanguka mara kwa mara, na pembe kali za meza za sebuleni, vitako vya TV na meza za kioo ziko hasa usawa wa vichwa na macho yao. Vilinda pembe laini hubandikwa kwenye kingo hizi na hupunguza mshtuko wa kugonga ambao vinginevyo ungeweza kukata au kuvilia damu. Chagua vilinda vinene vya sponji laini au silikoni vyenye gundi imara, safisha uso kabla ya kubandika, na kagua kila mwezi kama vimelegea, kwa kuwa kilinda kilicholegea ni hatari ya kusakamwa. Unganisha na kufunga samani ndefu na TV ukutani ili kuzuia kuanguka. Afya Basics huuza vilinda laini kama sehemu nafuu ya bidhaa zake za usalama wa nyumbani."],["Affordable home-safety add-on with good margin","Nyongeza nafuu ya usalama wa nyumbani yenye faida nzuri"]],"mb_sleep_lock":[["Poisoning from medicines, paraffin, bleach and pest sprays is a leading cause of injury in young children, often from a low cupboard opened in seconds. Child locks keep cabinet doors, drawers, fridges and appliances closed to small hands while adults open them easily. Choose adhesive flexible locks for doors with knobs or flat fronts, and multi-use straps for fridges and toilets; fit before the baby crawls. Locks support, but do not replace, storing medicines and chemicals high up in their original containers. Afya stocks several lock types because poison prevention fits naturally with a health store that sells medicines and cleaning products.","Kuwekewa sumu na dawa, mafuta ya taa, bleach na dawa za kupuliza wadudu ni sababu kuu ya ajali kwa watoto wadogo, mara nyingi kutoka kabati la chini linalofunguliwa ndani ya sekunde chache. Kufuli za watoto huweka milango ya makabati, droo, friji na vifaa vimefungwa kwa mikono midogo huku watu wazima wakivifungua kwa urahisi. Chagua kufuli zinazonata zinazopinda kwa milango yenye vishikio au iliyo bapa, na mikanda ya matumizi mengi kwa friji na vyoo; zifunge kabla mtoto hajaanza kutambaa. Kufuli husaidia, lakini hazichukui nafasi ya kuhifadhi dawa na kemikali juu katika vyombo vyake vya asili. Afya Basics huuza aina kadhaa za kufuli kwa sababu kuzuia sumu kunaendana kwa asili na duka la afya linalouza dawa na bidhaa za usafi."],["Safety item that pairs with every medicine and cleaner sale","Bidhaa ya usalama inayoendana na kila mauzo ya dawa na vifaa vya usafi"]],"mb_sleep_gate":[["Falls down stairs and burns in the kitchen are among the most serious home injuries for children under three. A safety gate keeps a crawler or toddler out of danger zones while the family carries on with daily life. Use a wall-fixed gate at the top of stairs, because pressure-fit gates can be pushed out, and a pressure-fit gate is fine for doorways and the bottom of stairs. Measure the opening, choose a gate that closes automatically with a two-action latch, and stop using it once the child can climb over, usually around two years. Afya stocks a wall-fix and an extra-secure pressure gate as high-value safety items for growing families.","Kuanguka ngazini na kuungua jikoni ni miongoni mwa ajali mbaya zaidi nyumbani kwa watoto chini ya miaka mitatu. Mlango wa usalama humzuia mtoto anayetambaa au mdogo kuingia maeneo ya hatari huku familia ikiendelea na shughuli za kila siku. Tumia mlango unaofungwa ukutani juu ya ngazi, kwa sababu milango inayobanwa kwa msukumo inaweza kusukumwa ikatoka, na mlango wa msukumo unafaa milangoni na chini ya ngazi. Pima nafasi, chagua mlango unaojifunga wenyewe wenye kitasa cha hatua mbili, na acha kuutumia mtoto anapoweza kuupanda, kwa kawaida karibu miaka miwili. Afya Basics huuza mlango wa kufungwa ukutani na wa msukumo wenye usalama zaidi kama bidhaa za usalama zenye thamani kubwa kwa familia zinazokua."],["High-value safety purchase with installation advice that builds trust","Ununuzi wa usalama wenye thamani kubwa pamoja na ushauri wa kufunga unaojenga imani"]],"mb_sleep_carrier":[["Carrying a baby close is a strong East African tradition, and a structured carrier spreads the weight across both shoulders and the hips, leaving the parent’s hands free and reducing back strain on long walks or bus journeys. Choose an ergonomic carrier that holds the baby’s legs in an M position, knees higher than bottom, which supports healthy hip development, with head support for young babies and breathable mesh for the heat. Follow the TICKS rule: tight, in view at all times, close enough to kiss, keep the chin off the chest and the back supported. Afya stocks affordable ergonomic carriers because they are practical, safe when used correctly and popular gifts for fathers too.","Kumbeba mtoto karibu ni desturi imara ya Afrika Mashariki, na kibebeo cha kisasa husambaza uzito kwenye mabega yote mawili na nyonga, kikiacha mikono ya mzazi huru na kupunguza maumivu ya mgongo katika matembezi marefu au safari za basi. Chagua kibebeo kinachoshikilia miguu ya mtoto katika umbo la M, magoti juu kuliko makalio, jambo linalosaidia ukuaji mzuri wa nyonga, chenye kishikio cha kichwa kwa watoto wadogo na neti inayopitisha hewa kwa ajili ya joto. Fuata kanuni ya TICKS: kibebeo kibane vizuri, mtoto aonekane wakati wote, awe karibu kiasi cha kumbusu, kidevu kisiguse kifua na mgongo ushikiliwe. Afya Basics huuza vibebeo nafuu vya kisasa kwa sababu ni vya vitendo, salama vikitumika vizuri na ni zawadi zinazopendwa hata kwa akina baba."],["Mid-value gift item that modernises a familiar habit","Bidhaa ya zawadi ya thamani ya kati inayoboresha desturi inayojulikana"]],"mb_sleep_paci":[["A soother can calm a fussy baby and, offered at sleep time, is associated with a lower risk of sudden infant death. For breastfed babies it is best introduced after about four weeks, once feeding is established, so it does not interfere with learning to latch. Choose a one-piece, BPA-free silicone soother sized for the baby’s age, with ventilation holes in the shield, and never attach it to a cord around the neck or dip it in sugar or honey. Sterilise regularly, replace every one to two months or at any sign of damage, and aim to stop by about one year to protect teeth and speech. Afya stocks value and premium soothers with clear safety guidance.","Nyonyo bandia inaweza kumtuliza mtoto anayesumbua na, ikitolewa wakati wa kulala, inahusishwa na hatari ndogo ya kifo cha ghafla cha mtoto. Kwa watoto wanaonyonya ni bora ianzishwe baada ya takriban wiki nne, kunyonyesha kukiwa kumeimarika, ili isiingilie kujifunza kushika titi. Chagua nyonyo ya silikoni ya kipande kimoja isiyo na BPA, ya saizi inayolingana na umri wa mtoto, yenye matundu ya hewa kwenye kinga yake, na kamwe usiifunge kwa kamba shingoni wala kuichovya kwenye sukari au asali. Iue vijidudu mara kwa mara, ibadilishe kila mwezi mmoja hadi miwili au ikionyesha uharibifu wowote, na lenga kuacha kufikia takriban mwaka mmoja ili kulinda meno na kuongea. Afya Basics huuza nyonyo bandia za bei nafuu na za hadhi pamoja na ushauri wazi wa usalama."],["Frequently replaced item sold with safe-use advice","Bidhaa inayobadilishwa mara kwa mara inayouzwa pamoja na ushauri wa matumizi salama"]]};window.dispatchEvent(new Event("afyatx"));